	quest.000E9F2ECF5432D5.quest_desc: [
		"With the crushing wheel you can convert cobblestone into gravel and sand in large quantities"
		""
		"Washing gravel, red sand and soul sand can yield iron, gold and quartz"
	]
	quest.000E9F2ECF5432D5.title: "Mass Production of Minerals"
	quest.00CE1F4328EC11AB.quest_desc: [
		"Conveyor belts are a simple and easy-to-use method of transporting items, and they can also be used for transmission. Such a convenient item will definitely be used in large amounts in the future. If possible, its raw material - kelp - can be mass-produced."
		""
		"It doesn’t matter if you don’t find kelp. There are other ways to get the conveyor belt. Check out JEI&7 (EMI) &r! &7 (Tip: Mechanical Pressing)"
		""
		"&aTips&r: The Depot can also be used as a conveyor belt, and no stress is required!"
		""
		"In addition, you can use containers &7 (especially large boxes and item safes) &r with funnels to transport items over short distances, which is very convenient."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Compared with the conveyor belt, the Depot certainly has disadvantages: for example, it is expensive and the items cannot be taken out directly from the Depot."
		""
		"Anyway, let’s make some conveyor belts oao."
		""
		"&aPS&r: I just wrote the extra recipe in case you can’t find kelp. Other integration packages will most likely not be able to use it."
	]
	quest.00CE1F4328EC11AB.title: "3.2 Kelp Logistics"
	quest.0189212CF2483E93.quest_desc: [
		"These ingredients are representative of creatures that can only be obtained by defeating creatures with &e Knife &r/&e Kitchen Knife &r, and come from pigs and endermites."
		""
		"The knives of Kaleidoscope and Farmer's Delight are basically interoperable. You can choose the one that feels better in the handle."
		""
		"&7 In fact, these products will be dropped as long as you cut them with a knife in the last blow. At other times, you can use an ordinary sword to cut them."
	]
	quest.0189212CF2483E93.title: "F4.3 Special Ingredients"
	quest.01A72753873DD8DE.quest_desc: ["Both dynamic structures require Deployers to replant saplings"]
	quest.01A72753873DD8DE.title: "H2.5 Necessary Deployer"
	quest.01AE879008D8F755.quest_desc: [
		"Exercise your logistics wiring skills."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Quick jump\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"175C11A7E58931AE\"}}"
	]
	quest.01AE879008D8F755.title: "H2.6.1 Mass-Producing of Fuel-Coal"
	quest.01C34E2A1F16EBF8.quest_desc: [
		"Press &eE&r to open the backpack. On the right is the item manager, and below is the &e search box &7 (supports search in Chinese, English, Pinyin, and Pinyin initials) &r."
		""
		"Move the mouse to the &e item &7 you are interested in (either in the backpack or in the item manager) &r, press &eU&r to see the use, press &eR&r to see how to obtain it"
	]
	quest.01C34E2A1F16EBF8.title: "Mom No Longer Has to Worry About Me Forgetting the Recipe!"
	quest.01D2AFDC5E35C0B6.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have the wood, it’s time to go mining. It will be much more convenient to bring these with you."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The speed of climbing ladders &7 (and scaffolding) &r has been epically enhanced, so don’t dislike it anymore."
	]
	quest.01D2AFDC5E35C0B6.title: "1.2 Stone Age"
	quest.0234D5EF778A3227.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Minecart Assembly Station to move the Deployer onto a minecart."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"This matter has been recorded in S1.7\",\"underlined\":true,\"color\":\"blue\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"263229837952BEAC\"}}"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Remember to turn on rotation lock"
	]
	quest.0234D5EF778A3227.title: "S2.5 Long Distance Dynamic Structure"
	quest.02ABE04F668CD001.quest_desc: [
		"It's certainly a good idea to use display connectors to summarize the health of physical structures onto a screen."
		""
		"Of course, please do what you can."
	]
	quest.02ABE04F668CD001.title: "Information Summary"
	quest.02AC24E1D7921EB0.quest_desc: [
		"During the game, occasionally the font &e&l will be ghosted into &r, which is caused by the &eMCsans+&r resource pack."
		""
		"Choose one of two solutions:"
		""
		"①Uninstall &eMCsans+&r in &e settings...&r/&e resource package...&r"
		""
		"② Download the additional module [&e Modern UI&r] &e ModernUI&r, at the cost of a small amount of text display being slightly misaligned."
	]
	quest.02AC24E1D7921EB0.title: "Font"
	quest.02DB3C1ECE2179FD.quest_desc: ["The Sophisticated Backpacks can obtain more functions by installing upgrade modules. Here are some more practical ones:"]
	quest.02DB3C1ECE2179FD.title: "O2.11 Upgrades"
	quest.03519B3E2CB89140.quest_desc: ["Brass Tunnel has a variety of diversion methods to meet almost all your needs"]
	quest.03519B3E2CB89140.title: "4.4 Intelligent Diversion"
	quest.03B2C386D1570502.quest_desc: [
		"Kelp is an important raw material. Be sure to collect some when you encounter them, and you will need to plant them later."
		""
		"If you urgently need a conveyor belt but cannot find kelp, you can first use coal to make some &7 (this manufacturing recipe does not exist in the original version, I added it manually)"
	]
	quest.03B2C386D1570502.title: "Kelp Drive"
	quest.0436FFFC388310C8.quest_desc: [
		"The chute can be used to easily feed the vertical grinding wheel."
		""
		"&aTips&r: There are pictures on the next page"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Example diagram:"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/s2_9_2.png width:256 height:142 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0436FFFC388310C8.title: "S2.9.2 Vertical Crushing"
	quest.0490516D16B022FC.quest_desc: [
		"The resonator can be used as a pickaxe, axe, shovel, or hoe at the same time for rapid destruction."
		""
		"Long press &e left Alt&r to switch modes, and then you can also use the right-click function of the corresponding mode - such as using it as an ax to peel off tree bark."
		""
		"When synthesizing the two resonators, &e will inherit the enchantment of the raw material &r, so you can directly use the tools you have at hand to synthesize it."
	]
	quest.0490516D16B022FC.title: "AC1.21.9 Resonator"
	quest.04D3E49C9BD5DA98.quest_desc: ["You can directly derive the stress from above or below the Chain Drive and connect it to the workpiece."]
	quest.04D3E49C9BD5DA98.title: "Stress"
	quest.052EEC12A5F2DD36.quest_desc: ["There are also some teleportation stone tablets naturally generated in the wild. They can help you travel through the world easily at the cost of consuming some experience based on the distance."]
	quest.052EEC12A5F2DD36.title: "S1.8.2 Waystone"
	quest.0550AC0D680BA949.quest_desc: [
		"Hold the cargo frog port and right-click the &e chain &r, then place the cargo frog port on the baler. In this way, Cargo Port will automatically process the parcels at this location."
		""
		"After putting it down, remember to rename the cargo frog port \"&e\" to &r. For example, if this is a warehouse, rename it &e warehouse &r."
	]
	quest.05554C4F04FC7D2E.quest_desc: ["At this point, all you need is to collect the products and transport them back, and the automation is complete."]
	quest.05554C4F04FC7D2E.title: "Collect Products"
	quest.055EE1EB615A1D5E.quest_desc: ["I don’t use this recipe much."]
	quest.055EE1EB615A1D5E.title: "S2.2.5 Mass-Producing of Fluorite"
	quest.05B2A7C2114EDC8F.quest_desc: ["Sometimes one grinding wheel cannot meet the demand and multiple grinding wheels need to be placed. Use brass tunnels to easily distribute raw materials and improve operational efficiency"]
	quest.05B2A7C2114EDC8F.title: "S2.9.4 Stacked Crushing Wheels"
	quest.062FEDF3AB2B437B.quest_desc: [
		"Build a simple rope pulley mining machine to mine a large area at a time to solve the problem of insufficient resources."
		""
		"Use the mining car assembly station to pack the mining machine and take it away. You can directly use the storage panel in Tom's simple storage to retrieve the items."
		""
		"&aTips&r: It is more convenient to use a windmill to provide stress"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"▷Build a mineral processing production line connected to your mining machine"
		""
		"▷Use dynamic structures in combination to allow your mining machine to move on its own"
		""
		"▷Add automatic drainage &8 (and magma) &r function to your mining machine"
	]
	quest.062FEDF3AB2B437B.title: "Mining Machine"
	quest.06BD7C3624E3270E.quest_desc: [
		"It’s not a problem to always rub precision components by hand. Let’s build a &9 machine [①] &r and let it run automatically. Do more at one time."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Click here to view logistics related tasks\",\"underlined\":true,\"color\":\"blue\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2E816548D1DE0868\"}}"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Remember to view the Deployer's Ponder scene"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&9Remarks&r:"
		""
		"&9①【Machine】&rThe machine here is not a specific block or equipment, it refers to an assembly line designed by you &e&r by yourself, including &e item transportation &7 (conveyor belt) &r and &e processing equipment &7 (Deployer) &r."
	]
	quest.06BD7C3624E3270E.title: "S2.5 Mass-Producing!"
	quest.06CA0ACF6DACA1B2.quest_desc: [
		"Engineer goggles can check the operating status of various Create machines."
		""
		"Wrenches can be used to quickly turn and disassemble mechanically powered equipment."
		""
		"They will accompany you on your Create journey."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Please do not use a wrench to perform chain destruction, as it will swallow blocks."
	]
	quest.06CA0ACF6DACA1B2.title: "S1.6.4 Engineers Should Behave Like Engineers"
	quest.06CF1E92496C2D66.quest_desc: [
		"Place the placeable food on the table and sit on the chair and right-click to eat the food on the table."
		""
		"You can get powerful potion effects that last for up to 30 minutes!"
		""
		"The cooked food will deteriorate if kept for a long time. Eat and stir-fry as you like. Don’t cook too much at once as it will be wasted!"
		""
		"&8 Boss, remember to eat cat rice before going on an adventure, meow!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Because the tag system of Kaleidoscope is not very well written, I am too lazy to write tasks."
		""
		"I’ll give you a set of tables and chairs directly! ("
		""
		"Open up!"
	]
	quest.06CF1E92496C2D66.quest_subtitle: "&cThis part is temporarily disabled"
	quest.06CF1E92496C2D66.title: "F3.7 Eat a Big Meal!"
	quest.06D4C3E526DAE55F.quest_desc: ["Scarecrows can protect surrounding farmland from being trampled"]
	quest.06D4C3E526DAE55F.title: "F1.15 Scarecrow"
	quest.072DA9EF2D5B6D65.quest_desc: [
		"Head to the savanna to find wild armadillos."
		""
		"Use the brush to right-click the armadillo to get scales."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"\\\"Everything You Ever Wanted to Know About Armadillos\\\"\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E7%8A%B0%E7%8B%B3\"}}"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Next &e Deployer &7 (Deployer) &r and &e Cushion &r Very useful"
	]
	quest.072DA9EF2D5B6D65.title: "H5.3.2 How Many Scales Does It Have?"
	quest.079FDC6C3116B4B4.quest_desc: [
		"In addition to Ponder, this mission system is also part of the guidance. If you don’t know what to do, just follow the mission route."
		""
		"For example, now, you can switch to the chapter \"&e Andesite Era &r\" and officially start the journey of Create."
	]
	quest.079FDC6C3116B4B4.title: "Task Guidance"
	quest.08164D6F47C14EF3.quest_desc: [
		"You should have noticed that if you continue to give the redstone signal, there will be a package if there is something in the small warehouse, and the transmission wheel will be filled to the brim——"
		""
		"If it is too full, it will cause traffic jams for other parcels in Frogport. What should I do?"
		""
		"At this time, you can use the existing transmitter to provide the redstone signal:"
		""
		"Attach the stock converter to the small warehouse, use redstone powder to connect the converter and the packer, and you're done!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The stock transponder can be used directly without configuration, but you can also make some adjustments, such as setting it to \"the number of items in the small warehouse &e ≥ 64 &r&8 (if not configured, the transponder defaults to ≥128) &r\" to output a redstone signal"
		""
		"A package can store 9 groups of items, so in machines with large output &7 (such as stone brushing machines) &r, the transmitter can be set to &e ≥ 9 groups &r to generate redstone signals"
	]
	quest.08164D6F47C14EF3.title: "Smart Activation"
	quest.082C92E76122BACB.quest_desc: [
		"After &e wind field &7 (the wind blown by the Encased Fan) &r passes through &e water &7 (or water-containing blocks, such as water-containing leaves) &r, it will become a washed &e processing wind field &r."
		""
		"The processing speed of the wind field has nothing to do with the rotational speed, but multiple processing wind fields can be superimposed to improve work efficiency."
		""
		"&aTips&r: It is not recommended to wash too much grit in one batch, as it is easy to get stuck."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The wind field &e cannot pass through the &r complete block, but some incomplete blocks &7 (such as metal beams and empty Blaze Burners) have very coincidental shapes -"
		""
		"The items that fall above them are just stuck in the middle of the upper and lower grids, which means that they can be processed by the wind fields of the upper and lower grids at the same time, further improving the processing efficiency."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Schematics:"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/encased_fan_eg.png width:256 height:144 align:center}"
	]
	quest.082C92E76122BACB.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone—[Crush]—>Gravel—&e[Wash]&r—>Iron Particles"
	quest.082C92E76122BACB.title: "2.13 Gravel"
	quest.083DA2FEC30E56A3.quest_desc: ["The raw materials are quite easy to collect and easy to mass-produce. You can also use them to make cakes for yourself."]
	quest.083DA2FEC30E56A3.title: "HS4.2.1 Raw Materials"
	quest.086003948C4C3044.quest_desc: [
		"&e Create: Aeronautics &r is an emerging Create attachment that allows you to build aircraft freely - so freely that it is almost impossible to start."
		""
		"Although I haven't compiled the relevant tutorials yet, I can at least provide some help with materials."
	]
	quest.086003948C4C3044.quest_subtitle: "Be sure to collect your prize near the warehouse"
	quest.086003948C4C3044.title: "O5.5 Aeronautics"
	quest.08751BF9AAAF13A1.quest_desc: [
		"&e resin block &7 (not amber block) &r containing living creatures has a small probability to become the corresponding &e resentment amber block &7 (high probability to become amber block) &r after &e time shift &r, which is the core raw material for making monster spawners."
		""
		"This requires the development of &e AnvilCraft &r technology - of course, the monster spawner is not necessary."
	]
	quest.08751BF9AAAF13A1.title: "F2.7 Artificial Monster Spawner"
	quest.0894A266F5654165.quest_desc: [
		"Have you ever found that you have a lot of the same items that need to be stored while working on the iron production line?"
		""
		"This is where Functional Storage drawers come in handy. They can store a large number of the same kind of items, so they are very suitable for use here."
	]
	quest.0894A266F5654165.title: "S2.12.1 Drawer Cult"
	quest.08BE372420D63E29.quest_desc: [
		"Finally, use the two-in-one forging template of the two resonators and the heavy halberd in the Ember Forging Station to create the over-limit resonator and the over-limit heavy halberd."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"How to obtain over-limit templates\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5428A8E531D969A5\"}}"
	]
	quest.08BE372420D63E29.quest_subtitle: "Finished with flowers~"
	quest.08BE372420D63E29.title: "S2.17.8 Artifact Dacheng"
	quest.08C6C0161A9864BE.quest_desc: [
		"This integration package &7 (actually not even an integration package, let’s call it that) &r does not have so many lofty goals, I just hope you can use it to understand Create."
		""
		"Even so, you still need to have a simple impression of the general skills for playing MC modules &7 (see subsequent tasks) &r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"There will be a lot of guidance content, which may give you a negative feeling of \"teaching you how to play the game\"; in some places, the guidance may be insufficient or even confusing."
		""
		"Apologize in advance"
	]
	quest.08C6C0161A9864BE.title: "How to Play the Integrated Package?"
	quest.0955E2B800DC1C95.quest_desc: [
		"Speaking of &e transmission &7 (transportation stress) &r, the first is of course the most basic &e Shaft &r!"
		""
		"The function of the Shaft is to transmit stress along a straight line, plain and simple."
		""
		"Some workpieces (such as power stamping machines) contain Shafts, which can also be used as Shafts."
		""
		"&aTips&r: There is no strict order requirement for this part of the tasks. The order of completion depends on your eyes."
	]
	quest.0955E2B800DC1C95.quest_subtitle: "This part is more like an instruction manual than a task, so there are no numbers ("
	quest.0955E2B800DC1C95.title: "Transmission"
	quest.098F5ADD42F45F21.quest_desc: [
		"Many times you will need to spread raw materials across multiple workpieces."
		""
		"When the item passes through the Andesite Tunnel, it will try to separate one to the side of the tunnel, which can be used with the Millstone &7 (or any other open container) &r."
		""
		"Containers such as boxes and vaults are more than one space wide. Attaching a few more funnels to them is also a way to divide/aggregate the traffic."
		""
		"&aTips: &r remember to view the Ponder scene"
	]
	quest.098F5ADD42F45F21.title: "3.4 Diversion"
	quest.09B330403F3C7545.quest_desc: ["Or stick it next to the warehouse. When the packer &c receives the redstone signal &r, it will &c and continue &r to pack the items in the container."]
	quest.0A68D103B8BE5DB4.quest_desc: [
		"Snow cubes will turn into ice when hit by an anvil on the cauldron, and a layer of fine snow will be produced in the cauldron. With this, you can mass-produce frost metal..."
		""
		"There are many ways to obtain fine snow, you can choose the one you like best."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Build a snow golem, and then use a power plow to destroy the snow that is constantly refreshing under the snow golem's feet to get a steady stream of snowballs."
	]
	quest.0A68D103B8BE5DB4.title: "AC1.16.1 Frost Metal"
	quest.0AA19D11C352F234.quest_desc: ["Props that help you control dynamic structures through redstone lines. If you don’t have a redstone foundation, you can skip it."]
	quest.0AA19D11C352F234.title: "S1.7.13 Post~"
	quest.0AC87DB1718993F2.quest_desc: ["There are many foods in Farmer's Fun that cannot be placed, but some of them can be placed on the dinner plate, and there are also models!"]
	quest.0AC87DB1718993F2.title: "F3.4 Place Food"
	quest.0B4E423D0F00553B.quest_desc: [
		"Store the deposited items in various forms such as blocks, ingots, and granules at the same time."
		""
		"Some irreversible compression formulas &7 (such as clay, quartz) &r can be forcibly opened."
	]
	quest.0B4E423D0F00553B.title: "O3.2 Compression Drawer"
	quest.0B6015A377AFF8C3.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Blaze to burn the stone to get lava, and then use it to make blaze cakes and feed it to the Blaze."
		""
		"It always feels weird, but it’s a method."
	]
	quest.0B6015A377AFF8C3.title: "S2.6.6 Pure Pulped Cobblestone"
	quest.0B84B2F18C3DC8DC.quest_desc: [
		"The cheapest way to make white dye is naturally to use bone meal."
		""
		"You should already have an automated farm, right?"
		""
		"Use the compost bucket to consume excess seeds and obtain bone meal."
		""
		"&aTips&r: There are many ways to use seeds, you can read JEI&7 (EMI)"
	]
	quest.0B84B2F18C3DC8DC.title: "HS5.4.3.4 Bleaching"
	quest.0BB11F4B6ECD25A8.quest_desc: [
		"Use connectors to connect beacons to the storage network, allowing you to access the storage network remotely or even across dimensions."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The storage connector is required to be in the &e loading &r state."
		""
		"You can simply understand that there must be &e people &r/&e block loader &r nearby; or the storage network should be built near the &e birth point &r."
	]
	quest.0BB11F4B6ECD25A8.title: "O4.5 Remote Access"
	quest.0BFDF28D91E1F1A8.quest_desc: [
		"Bread is made by smoking the dough in batches."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Smoking and washing can share the Encased Fan. You only need to add a campfire behind the original washing wind farm and you are done."
	]
	quest.0BFDF28D91E1F1A8.title: "H1.15 Bulk Smoking"
	quest.0C04B457C2D670B9.quest_desc: [
		"After collecting enough liquid experience, you can consider using these green things to copy enchanted books."
		""
		"A full set of Protection IV, Durability III, and Experience Repair armor is now at your fingertips"
		""
		"&7However, the villager exchange still needs to be prepared, and it can be used elsewhere."
	]
	quest.0C04B457C2D670B9.title: "E1.5 Enchanted Book Wholesale"
	quest.0C4EF4D4A37ADC06.quest_desc: ["Multiphase substances are the raw materials for the synthesis of resonators and heavy halberds."]
	quest.0C4EF4D4A37ADC06.title: "AC1.21.7 Heterogeneous Substances"
	quest.0C768DA9019E22C9.quest_desc: [
		"The usage method is similar to the storage bag. You can read the usage introduction in &eF3.5(1)&r."
		""
		"Different from the lunch basket, the food stored in the rice bag will \"flavor\", and each time you eat it, you can get the potion effect provided by all the food in the rice bag."
	]
	quest.0C768DA9019E22C9.title: "F3.10 Evolution Rice Bag"
	quest.0CB3B9C9C4BFAF6A.quest_desc: [
		"It can store a large amount of similar fluids, seriously squeezing the employment space of fluid storage tanks."
		""
		"Fluid storage tanks are pretty much just about boiling water."
	]
	quest.0CB3B9C9C4BFAF6A.title: "O3.3 Fluid Drawer"
	quest.0CB71FF44BE3CEB1.quest_desc: ["Shared Stones allow you to teleport directly to other Shared Stones of the same color without lighting them up, which is more convenient in multiplayer games."]
	quest.0CB71FF44BE3CEB1.title: "S1.8.3 Sharestone"
	quest.0CE7AF686BE2EFE5.quest_desc: [
		"When the iron ingot thrown by &c player &r passes through the hollow magnet, it has a chance to become a magnet."
		""
		"Alignment is too troublesome, try sticking yourself in a hollow magnet"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7 cannot be pinched with a chute, it is strictly guarded &r"
	]
	quest.0CE7AF686BE2EFE5.title: "AC1.5.1 This Is a Feature!"
	quest.0CF88205796A3F1F.quest_desc: [
		"This is the cozy little home you prepared for the hard-working blaze &m&8 (doubtful) &r. Use it to right-click &e Blaze &r or &e blaze monster spawner &r to transform it into a Blaze Burner."
		""
		"The netherworld is full of dangers. Bring the &e teleportation stone tablet &r. At least it will be much more convenient to travel to and from the fortress &7 (fortress) &r."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Fire retardant potion is very useful for fighting blazes."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"If you can't find the fortress, you can use the &e structure compass &r and search for &efortress&r."
	]
	quest.0CF88205796A3F1F.title: "1.9 \"warm Home\""
	quest.0D309C1374621C8A.quest_desc: ["It's a bit expensive, but everything is worth it"]
	quest.0D309C1374621C8A.title: "AC1.21.6 Expensive Collisions"
	quest.0D82EA971359499B.quest_desc: [
		"There are actually no important resources for you in the end. You can wait until you are done with your work before visiting them."
		""
		"&8 Since you have been playing with Create for so long, why not also design some machines for the ender dragon and the black guys?"
	]
	quest.0D82EA971359499B.title: "2.15 Heading Towards the End"
	quest.0DA337D6434410D6.quest_desc: [
		"Building a small black tower in the void outside the main island of the end is extremely efficient. Coupled with Deployer execution, the experience problem can be solved once and for all."
		""
		"After making it, remember to read the related content of \"Create: Enchantment Industry\""
	]
	quest.0DA337D6434410D6.title: "S2.17.1 Little Black Tower"
	quest.0DE0AD10085E2DB7.quest_desc: ["When the instrument is connected to a synthesis formula, the package can be sent to the power synthesizer for synthesis, and multiple packages can be merged and imported with the charter machine."]
	quest.0DE0AD10085E2DB7.title: "S4.10.1 Automated Synthesis"
	quest.0E14CA0D1F334373.quest_desc: [
		"Cursed gold ingots can be obtained by using gold ingots in the royal grinding wheel to remove curses."
		""
		"Where do all these curses come from?"
		""
		"When using the &e jewelry processing table to imitate &r keys and other items, the imitations will come with a curse."
	]
	quest.0E14CA0D1F334373.title: "HS5.2.3.1 Remove Curse"
	quest.0E261EE5B5EA8F41.quest_desc: [
		"The trick is to increase resistance!"
		""
		"The impurities in the potion also unexpectedly increased the yield, which was a double blessing."
	]
	quest.0E261EE5B5EA8F41.title: "S2.2.13 Grow up Quickly~"
	quest.0E2A14E3043A91C5.quest_desc: ["Stuffing a workbench into the backpack also comes with 9 storage spaces, which is quite practical."]
	quest.0E2A14E3043A91C5.title: "O2.16 Portable Workbench"
	quest.0E75BB7A7E113575.quest_desc: ["The storage controller can proxy a large number of drawers and is not required to be connected to the drawer"]
	quest.0E75BB7A7E113575.title: "S2.12.3 Storage Controller"
	quest.0E7C030F8D3D4F89.quest_desc: [
		"Don’t throw away the extra bread. You can use it to feed the villagers and trade supplies with them later."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"▷Build a village exchange"
		""
		"▷Use the trading desk to automate your trades"
		""
		"▷ Equipped with a villager trading fracture machine"
	]
	quest.0E7C030F8D3D4F89.title: "Villagers Breed"
	quest.0EBEB923AE73671A.quest_desc: ["The redstone requester can order &7 (needs to be manually configured in advance) &r to the storage network after receiving the redstone signal."]
	quest.0EDF4C9A21F28291.quest_desc: [
		"You should have prepared &e Encased Fan and &r for batch melting, right? Just transport the wood over."
		""
		"Multiple processing wind fields can be superimposed. If you are interested, you can build a multi-speed batch processing center."
	]
	quest.0EDF4C9A21F28291.title: "H2.6 Logistics"
	quest.0EF1BC9EBF6AE1D3.quest_desc: ["Obtain uranium through collision, get more of it"]
	quest.0EF1BC9EBF6AE1D3.title: "AC1.21.3 Uranium"
	quest.0F281521E69C4A60.quest_desc: [
		"There are also many &7 (really a lot) &r artifacts you can make right now."
		""
		"If you're in a hurry to progress, you can ignore them for now."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Remember to come back and read here later"
	]
	quest.0F281521E69C4A60.title: "S1.7 Other Artifacts"
	quest.0F492741358DF5E0.quest_desc: [
		"The materials consumed to make Andesite alloy with it are only half of the materials consumed to synthesize Andesite alloy manually."
		""
		"&aTips&r: In addition to throwing things directly into the work basin, you can also use a funnel to add materials to the work basin"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Use &e gear &7 (instead of Shaft) &r to pass the stress!"
		""
		"&eRemember to watch Sisuimiao! Remember to view the Ponder scene, thank you, meow!"
		""
		"In addition, the work basin will automatically output the product to the surrounding &e open containers &r&7 (work basin, storage table, conveyor belt, Andesite funnel, brass funnel, Depot, Millstone, grinding wheel...the work basin and Depot can also accept fluids) &f."
		""
		"This means you can easily isolate the product and just put an open container nearby."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The original funnel is not an open container"
	]
	quest.0F492741358DF5E0.quest_subtitle: "Industrial frother (not)"
	quest.0F492741358DF5E0.title: "1.7 Kitchen Utensils"
	quest.0FA4245F6B8D3912.quest_desc: [
		"This integration pack has modified the production recipes of many items, which means that some recipes are likely to be unavailable in other integration packs."
		""
		"I have to apologize, the instructional package with modified recipes is incompetent——"
		""
		"But I guarantee that this package can teach you how to play Create and how to play the integrated package."
		""
		"Considering that most integration packages will modify the synthesis formula, perhaps the modified formula is the advantage of this teaching package &7 (laughing)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"On the recipe query page, hold down &eCrtl&f and click the formula product with &e left mouse button &r to get the recipe id, for example:"
		""
		"&aminecraft&r:&6spruce_trapdoor&r"
		"&7[Definition]&r Added by &aminecraft&7 (mod)&r: &6spruce_trapdoor&7 (item)&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"All recipes with &zkubejs&r or &zkjs&r appearing in their IDs are content added to the integration package and cannot be used outside of this integration package. For example:"
		""
		"jei:/create/&zkjs&r/raw_earth_core_shard"
	]
	quest.0FA4245F6B8D3912.title: "Recipe Modification"
	quest.0FB7A7F78D570407.quest_desc: ["A classic but easy-to-use method that can help you quickly gather the cobblestones produced by the stone brushing machine."]
	quest.0FB7A7F78D570407.title: "S2.11.1 Running Water Collection"
	quest.0FF38519C23079ED.quest_desc: ["Also a decoration"]
	quest.0FF38519C23079ED.title: "O4.15 Can Also Be Dyed"
	quest.10275511180E910D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a small workstation that provides all the functionality you need up front: rolling, mixing, grinding, cutting and Encased Fan batch processing"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"▷Set the working speed of your workstation to 256rpm, that is, the speed at which stress is introduced into each workpiece is 256rpm."
		""
		"▷Increase the Encased Fan batch processing speed to 2 times speed and above."
		"&aTips: The batch processing speed of the &r Encased Fan has nothing to do with the working speed. Only by superimposing the wind fields of multiple Encased Fans can faster processing be achieved."
		""
		"▷Add automatic feeding and product caching to your workpieces."
	]
	quest.10275511180E910D.title: "Workstation"
	quest.102C4636E621290E.quest_desc: [
		"The main content of the Create 6.0 update is this new logistics system, which uses balers and link stations to form the &e logistics network &r."
		""
		"The reason why I mention it in the Bronze Age is because there is usually no need for this in the Andesite Age."
		""
		"&cAttention &f: Packages cannot be shipped by water."
	]
	quest.102C4636E621290E.title: "S2.12.5 Create 6.0"
	quest.1053C23A8B5552FE.quest_desc: [
		"The boiler can also produce &a2048su&r stress in the &e passive &r state, which is already quite big!"
		""
		"It is actually quite convenient to stack passive boilers, but the speed is slower."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When stacked, it looks like this:"
		"&7 \"equivalent\" refers to the stress produced by a single boiler"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/s_1_6_5.png width:256 height:144 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1053C23A8B5552FE.quest_subtitle: "When someone tortures you, don't give me away!"
	quest.1053C23A8B5552FE.title: "S1.6.5 Shhh, Don’t Tell Others That I Taught You"
	quest.1065B8AFEBAC48AF.quest_desc: [
		"Disposable version of teleportation stone"
		""
		"If you take damage during use, you will still be interrupted."
	]
	quest.1065B8AFEBAC48AF.title: "OS1.3.2 Teleport Scroll"
	quest.106C38491170F4B2.quest_desc: [
		"Yes, there’s Farmer’s Lay and Senra Story, this is the sink bag, we’re hopeless!"
		""
		"These contents are here to enrich your Create journey. If you don’t like it, you can ignore it."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"While wearing a straw hat, destroy the short grass and there is a chance to obtain the crop seeds from Kaleidoscope."
		""
		"In addition, the knives of these two mods are already interchangeable, so you don’t need to make two copies of the knife."
		""
		"Finally, the create:food module adds a lot of food, which looks ordinary, but in fact many foods will provide potion effects &8 (but the author was lazy and did not write it in the item description) &r."
		""
		"You can view them using JEI&8 (EMI) &r, just press \"U\"."
	]
	quest.106C38491170F4B2.title: "E1.7.3 Eat Something Good"
	quest.1085E91902D8E1AF.quest_desc: [
		"This is the final mission of this integration pack."
		""
		"In this series, the quest line will be played backwards - this is also the real common way to explore any module on your own: &e Backward Method &r"
		""
		"From now on, if you want to make anything, you must use JEI&7 (EMI) &r to reverse the process and raw materials step by step from the final product."
		""
		"Of course, the actual production is still done step by step from raw materials."
	]
	quest.1085E91902D8E1AF.quest_subtitle: "Countdown to completion"
	quest.1085E91902D8E1AF.title: "H5.1 Super Alloy"
	quest.108A7293964E6860.quest_desc: ["In addition to the basic raw materials, you also need a set of frost metal and ember metal weapons and tools."]
	quest.108A7293964E6860.title: "S2.17.1 Forging Template"
	quest.109BE3721445EE5E.title: "AC1.21 AnvilCraft Matryoshka Doll"
	quest.10D8C7654C651BEB.quest_desc: [
		"Connect the packer to any side of the container, and then use the redstone signal to activate the packer, and it will &e and &r continuously pack the items in the container into packages."
		""
		"One package can store 9 groups of items, and the package can be transported quickly through chain transmission wheels, which greatly improves logistics efficiency."
	]
	quest.10D8C7654C651BEB.title: "3.7 Packaging"
	quest.10E3D0924F832EC6.quest_desc: [
		"The trident can be repeatedly crafted through &e Heart of the Ocean &r&7 (renewable, remember to read the recipe) &r"
		""
		"The heavy hammer needs to bring the &e ominous sign &r buff to the trial chamber, and use the obtained ominous trial key to open the &e ominous treasure house &r to obtain the heavy core &7 (the probability is touching) &r"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Use an anvil to smash the lead block into the treasure house, which can make the treasure house forget that it has been opened."
		""
		"Additionally, both keys and heavy cores can be replicated using a jewelry crafting table"
	]
	quest.10E3D0924F832EC6.title: "AC1.21.10 Heavy Halberd Core"
	quest.10EB5A662608C367.quest_desc: [
		"Place the mouse on it and hold down &eShift&r to view the description."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The potato cannon can not only shoot potatoes, but its damage is linked to the type of ammunition &7 (Golden Carrot and Blaze Cake are recommended) &r."
		""
		"In addition, cannons and back tanks can be enchanted."
	]
	quest.10EB5A662608C367.title: "S2.15.1 Alternatives to Bows and Arrows"
	quest.10F6FE7BC7406958.quest_desc: [
		"Special filter for package destination addresses, aimed at experienced mechanics."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&e*&r is a wildcard character, representing any text of any length and any quantity, and can also be used in mechanically powered logistics systems."
		""
		"For example, \"flash &e*&r machine\" can match \"flash &e iron &r machine\", \"flash &ewitch&r machine\", \"flash &e Phantom &r machine\""
		""
		"But \"&e*&r machine\" cannot match \"&c which is &r brush &e pig &r machine &c machine &r\" &7 (if you want, you can use \"*brush* machine*\" to match this name)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"In addition to &e*&r, &e?&7 (English question mark) and &r are also wildcards, representing a word."
		""
		"For example, \"Brush &e? &r machine\" can match \"Brush &e iron &r machine\", but cannot match \"Brush &e female &c witch &r machine\""
		""
		"The two symbols can be used together to create complex patterns. For example, \"&e*&r text &1?&2?&3?&4?&r\" can match \"&eone two three four five&r text &1six&2seven&3eight&4nine&r\""
		""
		"This is useful when encoding &e package addresses &8 (a feature you probably won't use) &r."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Package Address Encoding Processing (Part 4 of this video)\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qqh6zME9n/\"}}"
	]
	quest.10F6FE7BC7406958.quest_subtitle: "Perverted niche ideas"
	quest.10F6FE7BC7406958.title: "4.7 Package Filters"
	quest.112A60B1E4DAD6AD.quest_desc: [
		"Using simple physics knowledge, let the &e large gear &r drive the &e small gear &r to rotate, and the speed can be doubled!"
		""
		"The effect of a single acceleration is not very obvious. It is recommended to repeat &e several times."
		""
		"Higher rotational speed means that the equipment can have higher working efficiency and higher stress consumption."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aTips&f："
		""
		"The operating efficiency of the machine is linked to the rotation speed, not the total amount of stress."
		""
		"Stress cannot be stored, and unused stress will disappear directly."
		""
		"In addition, detailed rotation speed and stress consumption information can be seen when wearing &e engineer goggles &7 (next mission) &r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Gear shifting reference diagram:"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/s1_6_3.png width:256 height:142 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The default upper speed limit is 256. Above this speed, the gears and Shafts will explode."
		""
		"Use &e engineer goggles &r to check the stress consumption of the workpiece, and use the tachometer to check the current speed."
		""
		"The Andesan casing can wrap the gear, making the gear transmission structure more compact."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The pictures are all works of other novice mechanics. While referring to them, you can also think about what areas can be improved:)"
	]
	quest.112A60B1E4DAD6AD.quest_subtitle: "Work efficiency is only linked to rotation speed"
	quest.112A60B1E4DAD6AD.title: "S1.6.3 Faster, Faster"
	quest.11B9BB3FA707DA1D.quest_desc: [
		"The original synthesizer is quite efficient and a good choice."
		""
		"&aTips&r: If you want to use Grandpa Niu &8 (the synthesizer really looks like Grandpa Niu www) &r, the brass tunnel can be of great help, remember to view its Ponder scene"
	]
	quest.11B9BB3FA707DA1D.title: "HS3.5.2 Grandpa Niu"
	quest.11D2770974ED6ABB.quest_desc: [
		"The second step in mass production of frost alloy"
		""
		"But other than that, titanium is useless."
		""
		"&8 can actually make a flying machine, but that thing requires electricity"
	]
	quest.11D2770974ED6ABB.title: "S2.2.7 Silver to Titanium"
	quest.11E5F573B98CA97B.quest_desc: [
		"Try using this logistics system to improve work efficiency——"
		""
		"Keep your warehouse stocked with ingredients so you don't have to run around between artifacts, and your studio table always stocked with chocolate berries!"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Automation example\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5329D3AD8C264AAE\"}}"
	]
	quest.11E5F573B98CA97B.title: "H2.12.1 Automation!"
	quest.11F5C25A065AA3EA.quest_desc: [
		"Farmer's Happy is an old-style cooking module. Most of the foods provided have high nutritional value and are suitable for daily consumption."
		""
		"Place the kitchen pot and frying pan on the &e heat source &7 (fire, campfire, magma block, stove, Blaze combustion chamber...) &r. Then you only need to add the ingredients according to the &e recipe &7 (check JEI) &r to automatically cook"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The basket is surprisingly practical, you can check its Ponder scene"
	]
	quest.11F5C25A065AA3EA.title: "F3.2 Farmer's Delight"
	quest.12011211264DC272.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click the air with a hand-held magnet to gather all falling objects around you."
		""
		"Right-clicking on the block will generate a magnetized node that will attract nearby dropped objects in a small area. This way you don't have to worry about throwing raw materials into the cauldron."
	]
	quest.12011211264DC272.title: "AC1.6.1 Drop Magnet"
	quest.12D50270D012C75B.quest_desc: [
		"Chocolate is a great food."
		""
		"In addition to eating it, you can also use it to perform some forbidden rituals, attract the power of the curse, and turn gold into cursed gold."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Ah, yes, there are many kinds of chocolate and you can eat them all, it’s normal."
		""
		"When you go to the supermarket to buy chocolate, there are many different brands!"
		""
		"Only mechanically powered &e chocolates &7 (Chinese) and &r can be used to craft cursed gold, make no mistake!"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/create_mixing_chocolate.png width:165 height:135 align:center}"
	]
	quest.12D50270D012C75B.title: "F3.8 The Power of Taboo"
	quest.12F6325DFF5A2511.quest_desc: [
		"A huge cake symbolizes your excellence in the culinary field!"
		""
		"Such a large cake has exceeded the processing range of ordinary kitchen utensils. Do you need to study the technology of &e anvil technology &r, or ask for help from some players who are good at industry?"
	]
	quest.12F6325DFF5A2511.title: "F3.9 Creates Wonders!"
	quest.12FCCFF67EB9D9B3.quest_desc: [
		"Tracks are no better than wheels, but maybe more stable?"
		""
		"The usage is basically the same as that of tires, but only &e speed difference &r can be used for steering."
	]
	quest.12FCCFF67EB9D9B3.title: "Track"
	quest.133F45D674B072EA.quest_desc: ["The rotating structure composed of Mechanical Bearings is also very suitable for tree planting, but if it is used to build a large tree farm such as a spruce tree farm, it will take up more space."]
	quest.133F45D674B072EA.title: "H2.3 Rotating Tree Farm"
	quest.13729347EEB874B9.quest_desc: ["Brass hoppers and smart chutes can be filtered directly to sort the items you need"]
	quest.13729347EEB874B9.title: "H1.12 Filter"
	quest.13B8ADC73C056AFB.quest_desc: [
		"Dynamic synthesizers can also create some interesting utility tools."
		""
		"&e symmetry staff &r can improve your construction efficiency, &e potato cannon &r is a strong long-range weapon, &e telescopic manipulator &r can increase your interaction range."
		""
		"&7 is recommended to be used with a gas tank"
		""
		"In addition, there are many interesting tools, which will be listed in the next task."
	]
	quest.13B8ADC73C056AFB.title: "S2.8.1 Rare Stuff"
	quest.13CB6BB1680BF625.quest_desc: ["This part requires Andesite alloy to make"]
	quest.13CB6BB1680BF625.title: "Statement"
	quest.1456D6B04B4DA15A.quest_desc: ["Multiple item vaults can be linked to each other to form large containers, which can be connected to a large number of packers or hoppers, making them very suitable for use as logistics centers."]
	quest.1456D6B04B4DA15A.title: "S3.7.1 Large Container~"
	quest.1480AE598B3F5363.quest_desc: [
		"The subsequent synthesis cannot bypass the beacon, so you will have to kill a few withers."
		""
		"If you are not confident in your skills, you can consider sticking the wither into the bedrock at the top of the Nether. There are many tutorials at Station B."
	]
	quest.1480AE598B3F5363.title: "AC1.15 Beacon"
	quest.152C662A5793BE8E.quest_desc: ["Use them to remotely control your logistics system, see its Ponder scene for details"]
	quest.152C662A5793BE8E.title: "S2.12.8 Management Logistics System"
	quest.15347E77C3F75184.quest_desc: [
		"Here are some tools that can replace most of the complex redstone wiring and help you build physical structures more easily."
		""
		"&aTips&r: See the item description for how to use it."
	]
	quest.15347E77C3F75184.title: "Simplify Wiring"
	quest.154416D3A6801D63.quest_desc: [
		"There is no doubt that farming is an important source of cooking ingredients."
		""
		"In this integration package, some recipe ingredients also need to be obtained through farming."
		""
		"So, pick up the hoe and get to work!"
	]
	quest.154416D3A6801D63.quest_subtitle: "\"Shennong is reincarnated, and when he arrives in another world, he must show his true skills!\" 》"
	quest.154416D3A6801D63.title: "F1.1 Farming!"
	quest.156A3365E209D363.quest_desc: [
		"If you are temporarily short of certain supplies in subsequent missions, you can temporarily get some on credit here."
		""
		"Yes, it's on credit, so you don't have to pay it back."
	]
	quest.156A3365E209D363.quest_subtitle: "&cAbuse of this feature may harm the gaming experience"
	quest.156A3365E209D363.title: "Credit"
	quest.15C05C2A9039B324.quest_desc: ["One of the ways to remove items from a dynamic structure"]
	quest.15C05C2A9039B324.title: "S1.7.13 Automated Retrieval"
	quest.175C11A7E58931AE.quest_desc: [
		"Mount the power saw on a dynamic structure to cut down the entire tree at once and automatically collect the dropped objects &7 (if there is a container) &r."
		""
		"Robotic arm used to replant saplings"
	]
	quest.175C11A7E58931AE.title: "H2.1 No Matter What, Let’s Mass-Produce Wood First."
	quest.17D89E90D4C73DFC.quest_desc: [
		"This is the graduation material of this integration package - Translimit Alloy."
		""
		"Translimit Alloy is a complex material that requires a large amount of iron and gold to be processed using dragon breath, experience, and potions."
		""
		"It's complicated to make, but it's all worth it, because it is the raw material for synthesizing various &zcreated items &r."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Click here to jump to the guided task\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1085E91902D8E1AF\"}}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aTips&r: You can also use the recipe of \"&e Anvil Craft &f\" to make transfinite alloy, although it is not easier."
		""
		"With good luck &7 (human words: when there is a lucky effect) &f can also obtain ultra-limit alloy ingots from the treasure house in the end."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Random thoughts:"
		""
		"I see that many packs like to create a complicated endgame item, so I just follow the Romans..."
		""
		"But it’s not completely done. At least the number of cycles is not like others’ five or six hundred times, and the process is not very complicated."
	]
