	quest.1987C1711966FB61.quest_desc: [
		"Many modpacks add so many items that the original backpack is completely inadequate."
		""
		"The module \"&e Exquisite Backpack &r\" provides a huge backpack and various convenient upgrade plug-ins to make your travel more convenient."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Press &eE&r to open the backpack. There is a small ring in the upper left corner of the character, which is the &e accessories column &r. You can put the backpack in the &e back piece &r, so that the backpack will not occupy your breastplate slot."
		""
		"Press the &eB&r key to quickly open the Sophisticated Backpacks. In addition, the backpack can be upgraded to gain more space, see the chapter on Sophisticated Backpackss for details."
