	quest.203380ED9BC38B15.quest_desc: [
		"Frost Metal is a relatively cheap alloy that can be used to upgrade Royal Steel weapons and tools."
		""
		"In addition, it can also create some more powerful talismans, and is one of the raw materials for multi-phase substances."
	]
	quest.203380ED9BC38B15.title: "S2.2.8 Frost Metal Ingot"
	quest.20478B1B35E6429D.quest_desc: [
		"The cultivation of these crops is quite different from ordinary crops."
		""
		"Pumpkins and watermelons: The seeds will grow into &e melon vines &r, and then the melon vines will try to grow a corresponding melon into the surrounding &e open space &r. It can be destroyed with &e power saw &r, &e power drill bit &r."
		""
		"Cocoa beans: need to be planted on the side of &e jungle wood &r. Can be harvested with &e power harvester &r."
		""
		"Bamboo: Planted on the top of a block such as soil or sand, bamboo shoots and bamboo will try to grow upward. Can be harvested with &e power saw &r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Sugarcane: Plant it on the top of blocks such as soil and sand in &e near water &r, and then try to grow upward, up to three blocks long. Can be harvested with &e power saw &r."
		""
		"Kelp: Planted at the bottom of the water, it will try to grow taller and will not exceed the water surface. It can be harvested with &e power saw &r, &e power harvester &r."
		""
		"Cactus: Plant it on the sand, and then try to grow up to three blocks. If there are blocks in the 4 squares next to the cactus, the cactus will &e be automatically destroyed &r."
		""
		"Apple: Destroying oak leaves &7 (including dark oak leaves) has a &r probability of falling."
	]
	quest.20478B1B35E6429D.title: "F1.4 Special Crops"
	quest.2056328E74370A67.quest_desc: ["Drawers with customizable textures are a good thing"]
	quest.2056328E74370A67.title: "O3.4 Decorate It"
	quest.2057A20E7F0C1E8F.quest_desc: [
		"The cage added by Jinzhi Decoration can directly catch small creatures and take them away, which is very convenient."
		""
