	quest.220B58C7BF98AD45.title: "O3.17 Say Goodbye to Liquidation"
	quest.220BD2647ED0E33F.quest_desc: [
		"When the power saw is placed upward, it can process some items &a①&r, such as peeling logs and sawing a piece of andesite into 6 Shafts."
		""
		"Of course, its job is to replace the ax to destroy blocks. What’s special is that it can chop down an entire tree &7 (see the Ponder scene for details) &r at one time. It is also very suitable for deployment on &e dynamic structure &r using &a②&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&a Notes ① &r: It is worth noting that when an item has multiple processing recipes, the power saw will execute these recipes in sequence."
		""
		"This not only wastes resources, but also causes lag. Fortunately, it has a filter tank so you can filter the formula you need to avoid these problems."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&a Notes ②&r: Dynamic structure related tasks require making super glue to unlock, but you can just make it yourself."
		""
