	quest.25C40E93F22FDAC6.title: "O2.19 Unique"
	quest.25F2421EDCDE70CE.quest_desc: [
		"When the piezoelectric crystal is hit by an anvil, it will generate electricity. After being collected by the current collector, it is transmitted to the electrical appliances through the transmission pole."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Click here to view the pulse generator instruction manual\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.mcmod.cn/item/884568.html\"}}"
	]
	quest.25F2421EDCDE70CE.title: "AC1.7 Power Generation"
	quest.263229837952BEAC.quest_desc: [
		"The minecart assembly station is pretty awesome, you can use it to quickly move a large number of blocks &7 (such as a large item vault) &r."
		""
		"At present, deploying power drills on the mine car structure may not be a good choice, after all, it cannot automatically extend the rails..."
		""
		"However, using the two &e Deployers &r I gave you is enough to automatically pave the road and keep the minecart structure moving."
		""
		"Don’t forget to use the &e power plow &r to recycle the rails!"
		""
		"&aTips: Feed &r to &e powered mine cart and &r can run for a long time with a piece of coal. It is cheap, sturdy and easy to use."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"By allowing the minecart to move back and forth quickly within a small area, the workpieces carried on the dynamic structure of the minecart can work at ridiculously fast speeds."
		""
		"This technique is called &e shaking minecart &f. It is very vivid and easy to use, but I will not teach you &7 (for a reason oao) &f."
		""
		"If you want to learn, just find a tutorial yourself."
	]
	quest.263229837952BEAC.title: "S1.7.8 Thomas the Tank Engine Is Starting!"
	quest.26737A5660E83B28.quest_desc: [
		"To consume fuel and fly quickly, the operation instructions are as follows:"
		""
		"&a Spacebar &r: Start engine/increase engine power"
		""
		"&aLeft Shift&r: Engine shutdown/reduce engine power"
		""
		"&aW key &r: push the control lever &7 (machine head down)"
		""
		"&aS key &r: Pull the control lever &7 (machine head upward)"
		""
		"Take off after the ground speed is high enough"
		""
		"OK, you can fly a plane, go and play"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"{\"text\":\"Biplane driving guide——By Vanilla\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.mcmod.cn/post/3942.html\"}}"
		""
		"It is difficult for the &c biplane to take off and land. If you are not careful, it will crash and kill you."
		""
		"&a runway design:"
		""
		"Biplanes require runways for takeoff and landing."
		""
		"Without upgrades, in order to achieve the necessary take-off speed, the length of the runway should be around &e60 meters &7 (1 meter = 1 grid in the game, the same below) and the width should be around &e7 meters &r."
		""
		"It is recommended to lay light sources on both sides of the runway and at the center line of the runway to indicate the runway at night."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&a flight - final preparations before takeoff"
		""
		"Before taking off, please do the following checks:"
		""
		"Fuel: A biplane needs to consume a large amount of fuel &e when flying &r. Please estimate the required fuel &7 based on the range (the default fuel is coal, blaze powder and any items that can be recognized as fuel by the furnace) &r."
		""
		"Weapons: &e does not recommend &r to insert weapons into the weapon slot before taking off to avoid accidents."
		""
		"Food and other necessities."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&a takes off"
		""
		"The plane does not need fuel when taxiing on the ground, and even if the engine is turned on, it will not taxi faster. Therefore, please do not turn on the engine &r before the &e is aligned with the center line of the runway."
		""
		"After aligning with the center line of the runway, adjust the aircraft's engine to maximum power. Please do not pull the control lever at this time, otherwise the tail of the aircraft will contact the ground."
		""
		"When the distance from the ground is at least 5 meters, &r, you can pull the control stick slightly. Be careful not to make the aircraft's elevation angle too large (preferably within 40°), otherwise it will cause the aircraft to stall."
		""
		"&a is an upgrade module that can be used to shorten the takeoff taxiing distance:"
		""
		"Nether engines, steel boilers, reinforced pipes, improved landing gear"
		""
		"&aTips&r: You can also use a Encased Fan to directly blow the aircraft to takeoff speed"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aCruising"
		""
		"When reaching the cruising altitude, you can push the control stick slightly to lower the nose angle to nearly level with the ground."
		""
		"During cruising, you need to always pay attention to and adjust the nose angle. You can adjust the pitch angle of the aircraft to adjust the flight speed &c (remember, do not adjust the flight speed by adjusting the engine power unless necessary) &r."
		""
		"The aircraft may deviate from the route due to wind during flight, so please always pay attention to the aircraft's heading or install the upgrade module &7 (gyro) &r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&a landed"
		""
		"Before arriving at the destination, the aircraft should descend in advance, adjust its attitude, and align it with the runway."
		""
		"When an aircraft enters the runway, its nose depression angle should not be greater than 10°, otherwise it may cause the aircraft to crash."
		""
		"Since the aircraft of this module does not have a braking function, the generator should be turned off before entering the runway, and the aircraft's own inertia should be used to enter the runway while fine-tuning the nose angle."
		""
		"If the speed is too fast when entering the runway, you should immediately pull the control lever &7 (head up and accelerate) &r, go around and re-enter the runway."
		""
		"When the aircraft completes deceleration and taxiing on the runway, it should leave the runway immediately."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aRemoval"
		""
		"Using melee attacks on the aircraft &7 (and other aircraft) &r will eventually turn it into a drop. The items in the aircraft inventory will be scattered in the world. The items in the fuel tank and upgrade slot will be saved in the aircraft drops in the form of data."
		""
		"&afix"
		""
		"If the aircraft's health value &7 (an icon similar to a \"wrench\") &r is not full, when the player is not on the vehicle, it can be repaired by long pressing the right button of the mouse. This operation has a higher priority than loading the vehicle, which means that the vehicle can only be loaded after the vehicle is repaired."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aOther matters needing attention"
		""
		"Adjust your &e render distance to &r"
		""
		"The maximum flight speed of the biplane is relatively fast, so please increase the rendering distance as much as possible and make necessary attitude adjustments in advance. If the dedicated server limits the rendering distance of the client, you can use a module like a minimap to estimate terrain and block loading conditions in advance. If the speed is too fast and you fly into a block where &7 (or rendering) &r is not loaded, you can wait for a while or exit and reconnect."
		""
		"&a server"
		""
		"In the server &7 (dedicated server) &r, if the player disconnects from the server while flying, the aircraft's engine power will be set to off when the player re-enters the server. But the aircraft will not fall in free fall, it will still maintain the attitude and state it had before exiting."
	]
