	quest.295B5425E0E67AAA.quest_desc: [
		"Facing the increasingly complex demand for raw materials, you may be able to start building a logistics center - build it with style and don't let others look down on us."
		""
		"Create 6.0 adds a new logistics system. Place the &e baler &r next to the barrel containing charcoal on the boiler side, and then attach the &e factory instrument &r and &e warehousing link station &r to the baler."
		""
		"Right-click the meter with charcoal and you can set how much charcoal you want to save here."
		""
		"When the reserve is lower than this amount, the instrument will automatically request charcoal from the storage network through the storage link station for replenishment. You only need to arrange the logistics route to transport the charcoal to the boiler."
	]
	quest.295B5425E0E67AAA.title: "H2.9 Logistics Center"
	quest.2970DBA86BE9E560.quest_desc: [
		"When the hose pulley extracts water and magma, if the connected liquid exceeds &e ten thousand blocks &7 (usually the magma lake can meet this requirement) &r, it will be considered infinite."
		""
		"&e Nether &7 (Hell) &r is a good source of magma. There are many ways to transport items across latitudes: such as &e train &r, such as transporting &e dropped objects &7 (magma bucket, fluid drawer) &r."
		""
		"You can also prepare a very deep pool and pour 10,000 barrels of magma into it to obtain unlimited magma."
