	quest.2C1301A9907AB057.quest_desc: [
		"On the outer island of &e, &r will refresh some trial rooms sporadically. After successfully challenging, you can obtain the key and open the treasure house."
		""
		"Please pack your equipment before setting off, it's still a bit strong, probably."
