		"The treasure house can be opened multiple times: put the &e lead block &r on the treasure house and smash it with the falling &e anvil &r to open the treasure house again."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"How lead is made\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"214357CF42EF2C0D\"}}"
		""
		"Due to some strange performance issues, &7 temporarily replaced the complete trial chamber with a small structure."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When carrying &e Ominous Omen &r, the challenge becomes &c harder &7 (seriously) &r, but more advanced treasure chests can be unlocked."
		""
		"Bring the &e lucky &r effect to open the treasure house and get more and stronger loot."
		""
		"&7Good things are in the ominous treasure house, remember to bring rum!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Due to performance issues, dungeon generation is set up to make it extremely easy to generate dead ends."
		""
		"But under extreme conditions, there is still a very small probability of generating a relatively large dungeon - mainly because I was reluctant to delete it after writing it, but the probability was written very low."
		""
		"If I encounter you, treat it as an easter egg. Logically speaking, occasionally generating a slightly larger dungeon will not seriously affect performance..."
		""
		"I'm still a beginner when it comes to terrain generation, so any advice is welcome. If you encounter any problems, please understand orz"
	]
	quest.2C1301A9907AB057.title: "S2.17.4 Trial"
	quest.2CE821475BC7BFE8.quest_desc: [
		"Press and hold the tilde keys \"&e~&r\" &7 (if nothing else, the tilde key is at the top left of your keyboard, the first one below the Esc key) &r to activate chain mining. After activation, the status prompt of chain mining will be displayed in the upper left corner of your screen."
