	quest.2EF4CFFEACC11C2C.quest_desc: [
		"Resurrection soil is the nether version of fertile soil, obtained by \"forgetting\" the soul-forgetting fertilizer placed in the nether."
		""
		"\"Forgetfulness\" will be accelerated when there are &e open flames &7 (working furnaces, lit candles, etc.) &r, &e lava &r, &e activators &7 (wounding vines, weeping vines, various mushrooms and colonies, nether warts, soul sand, bones, wither roses, resurrected fertile soil, soul-forgetting fertilizer) &r."
