	quest.34CB3F726EEE85B5.quest_desc: [
		"Used to copy and apply already set filters, similar to a mechanically powered clipboard."
		""
		"In addition, when connecting a multi-block container to a storage network, you need to use it &e to remove excess blocks &r&7 (usually only one block is retained) &r, otherwise the inventory statistics in the storage network will be wrong and a lot of lag will occur."
	]
	quest.34CB3F726EEE85B5.title: "O4.20 Copy and Paste"
	quest.3547FA56F0388380.quest_desc: [
		"The storage connector will automatically organize all &e containers &7 (blocks that can hold things, such as boxes, barrels, drawers, backpacks, funnels...) &r connected to it, as well as containers connected through containers or cables, into a &e storage network &f, and can interact with the outside world on behalf of all containers in the network at the same time."
		""
		"Two storage connectors cannot access the same network, but a container can access multiple networks at the same time."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aTips&r："
		""
		"1. It is easy to get stuck if there are too many boxes. It is recommended to use wooden barrel &7 (it is more recommended to use an item vault)"
		""
		"2. If you want to connect the item vault to the storage network, be sure to keep only one vault &e&r&7 (see related tasks for details)"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"look here look here\",\"underlined\":true,\"color\":\"blue\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"34CB3F726EEE85B5\"}}"
