	quest.3547FA56F0388380.title: "O4.1 Core Build"
	quest.355F3C687746614C.quest_desc: ["Here, in addition to attracting thunder, you can also use dragon breath to transform transcendent experience"]
	quest.355F3C687746614C.title: "E1.12 Bulk Termination"
	quest.35ACDC55ED20BAEB.quest_desc: ["The efficiency is too low, but it is more convenient"]
	quest.35ACDC55ED20BAEB.title: "O3.19 Integrated Obsidian Machine"
	quest.35BE83CC6ACDBC05.quest_desc: [
		"Right-clicking the Waystone can consume experience to quickly move to other activated Waystone, which is very convenient."
		""
		"In addition to man-made ones, teleportation stone tablets are also generated in the world, such as in villages."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"No experience required for short distance teleportation"
		""
		"When the target distance is 1000~2000 squares, teleportation requires one level of experience."
		""
		"When the target distance is 2000~3000 squares, teleportation requires level 2 experience."
		""
		"Cross-world teleportation or target distance 3000 extra consumes level 3 experience"
		""
		"After right-clicking to activate it, the minimap will mark it and generate a light beam. You can turn off this feature in the settings."
	]
	quest.35BE83CC6ACDBC05.title: "O1.4 Waystone"
	quest.35DCD1A9FEE91CB8.quest_desc: ["Linen can be synthesized into thread at a ratio of 1:1"]
	quest.35DCD1A9FEE91CB8.title: "O2.2 Linen Thread"
	quest.36BF32980D7F2389.quest_desc: [
		"Create can be used to make potions in batches, and sprinklers can be used to sprinkle fluid down at a speed of 100mb/time."
		""
		"By combining the two, you can automatically spray potions on all creatures to heal them..."
		""
		"&eThen hit them hard with the anvil"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&e*&r is a wildcard character, representing any text of any length and any quantity, and can also be used in mechanically powered logistics systems."
		""
		"For example, the &e*&r machine here can match the &e iron &r machine, the &ewitcher&r machine, and the &e Phantom &r machine."
		""
		"[ \"This will be useful when using \", { \"text\": \"Cargo Frogport\", \"color\": blue, \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1EBE33170D6B21D8\" } }, \".\" ]"
	]
	quest.36BF32980D7F2389.quest_subtitle: "Respect all living things equally"
	quest.36BF32980D7F2389.title: "AC1.6.6 Flash* Machine"
	quest.36F5C01A7406A0BF.quest_desc: [
		"The power arm can move items in groups, with small restrictions, and can perform well in some tricky scenes."
		""
		"But its current task is to automatically feed the Blaze with fuel &r..."
		""
		"Of course, its functions are not limited to these, and you can also consider entrusting it to it for all future transportation needs."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"An example of the power arm automatically feeding the blaze to drink magma:"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/s2_6.png width:256 height:142 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Principle explanation:"
		""
		"First of all, this is a boiler with &e magma and &r as fuel. Compared with solid fuel boilers, it has one more step - liquid injection."
		""
		"In the picture, the &e injector &r will inject magma into the iron bucket in the storage platform on the upper right, and the brass funnel &7 (filtering magma bucket) &r will drain the magma bucket to the storage platform below."
		""
		"After that, the power arm will take the magma bucket from the storage platform below, feed it to the Blaze Burner, and then put the empty bucket into the brass funnel &7 (empty filter bucket) &r on the upper right."
		""
		"You can use the &e power pipette &r to skip liquid injection and feed magma directly to the combustion chamber."
	]
	quest.36F5C01A7406A0BF.title: "2.6 Servitor"
	quest.36F5E3EECFB6D761.quest_desc: ["A backpack that may stay with you for a long time"]
	quest.36F5E3EECFB6D761.title: "O2.8 Cheap Luxury Goods"
	quest.37260C62D6417351.quest_desc: [
		"Now, you can get rid of gear shifting and switch to high-tech - speed controller!"
		""
		"&aTips&r: The &e gear end &r of the speed controller and the &e interface &7 (Shaft) &r are bidirectionally connected. Input from any port, you can adjust the speed to the value you set, and then output from the other end."
	]
	quest.37260C62D6417351.title: "2.7 Essential for Engineers"
	quest.373702FA6AEFC5C5.quest_desc: ["Passing liquid fertilizer into the sprinkler can accelerate the growth of crops in the space from &e to the second grid &r starting from &e5*5*7&7 (length*width*height) &r directly below the sprinkler."]
	quest.373702FA6AEFC5C5.title: "F1.10 Liquid Fertilizer"
	quest.375E9A144E057AFC.quest_desc: ["By attaching it, you can access the &e storage network &r through the &e warehouse transmitter &8 (mainly the warehouse manager you arrange to sit next to it) &r, and allow additional manual control of item transportation"]
	quest.375E9A144E057AFC.quest_subtitle: "It is recommended that you complete all other quest lines before reading here."
	quest.375E9A144E057AFC.title: "Storage Network"
	quest.376B0226F9435FAD.quest_desc: [
		"This is a magical prop from Tom's Simple Storage that allows you to access containers &7 (such as storage tables, hoppers, item vaults, etc.) &r"
		""
		"You can also glue it to a dynamic structure to directly access the items in the dynamic structure."
		""
		"&aTips&r: After entering the brass era, you can set up the Internet of Things and let the production line automatically call the raw materials in the warehouse."
		""
		"Before that, you can use mission rewards to build a prototype in advance and access the warehouse &7 (instead of borrowing other modules) &r with more Create."
	]
	quest.376B0226F9435FAD.title: "E1.7.1 Makes Me Healthy!"
	quest.37ABD5801057FBE9.quest_desc: ["Similarly, you need the corresponding forging template to make frost metal weapons and tools"]
	quest.37ABD5801057FBE9.title: "S2.2.9 Frost Metal Forging Template"
	quest.3804A26316AC0091.quest_desc: ["It is also recommended to set up a small warehouse to temporarily store products. After all, there are still a lot of products for large-scale operations of crushing wheels."]
	quest.3804A26316AC0091.title: "Cache"
	quest.385E701E2A01ECC8.quest_desc: [
		"In the AnvilCraft, if the anvil destroys 20% of the creature's health, it will get a drop. The iron golem drops iron, and you can use the iron to restore blood..."
