	]
	quest.3AC7DED6E715F8EC.title: "1.6 Young People’s First Industrial Equipment"
	quest.3B0BCCECEE8775BF.quest_desc: ["&e can use the resin block to right-click on the villagers. &r can put the villagers into the resin block, and then right-click to release the villagers."]
	quest.3B0BCCECEE8775BF.title: "AC1.9.1 Catch...recruit Villagers"
	quest.3B19E316E545E2C0.quest_desc: [
		"After using the crushing wheel to crush the coarse ore, you can get two pieces of crushed ore. Each piece of crushed ore can be smelted into one mineral ingot, or washed into 9 mineral grains + one by-product."
		""
		"The crushing wheels can be stacked. Try to build a large crusher to handle the huge crushing needs."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"▷Automatically separate the crushed ore and equip it with washing and compression production lines"
		""
		"▷Use Cargo Wagon Lane to connect the crushing wheel to your logistics system"
		""
		"▷Similar to the crushing wheel, manufacture large-scale stamping processing centers and mixing processing centers, and connect them to the logistics system"
	]
	quest.3B19E316E545E2C0.title: "Mineral Processing"
	quest.3B6D08C930787F82.quest_desc: [
		"Royal steel is characterized by being very expensive."
		""
		"Another way to strengthen weapons and tools besides netherite, but unfortunately it cannot strengthen armor..."
		""
		"But you can use it to make amulets and other gadgets"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Both diamonds and emeralds can be obtained continuously from villagers, and villagers can be easily transported with &e resin blocks and &r."
		""
		"Additionally, resin cannot be obtained by crushing spruce wood."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"If you are not satisfied with the villager's trading options, smash it with &e anvil &r to reset the trading options. The price is that the villager has a small chance to become &e Green-robed Venerable &7 (fool villager) &r."
		""
		"You can also make a &e emerald talisman &r. When you put it in the &e inventory &r, the villagers will give you a discount."
		""
		"Finally, you can use the &e trading shelf &r to realize automatic trade, which is a good way to obtain emeralds in batches."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The recipe for the &eGem Processing Table&r is a &eduplication&7 (forging)&r recipe&7 (that is, you need to already have your first Emerald Amulet before you can use the Gem Processing Table to make a second one)&r. For the first amulet, sequential processing is still recommended."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can also use Royal Steel to build laser mining equipment, which requires electricity and is very unmechanical."
		""
		"So I have set up other methods for Create production of these miscellaneous ores. You don’t need to do laser mining."
	]
	quest.3B6D08C930787F82.quest_subtitle: "This is not about Create, but it might interest you"
	quest.3B6D08C930787F82.title: "S1.11.1 Where Does It Come From?"
	quest.3BC40A2C1C254A3A.quest_desc: [
		"The amethyst sword comes with &e decapitation &r enchantment &7 (the highest level III) &r, so it should be more convenient for you to collect withered skulls"
		""
		"In addition, there is a new structure in the netherworld, which contains many wither skeleton spawners and many decorative wither skulls, which are very suitable for use."
	]
	quest.3BC40A2C1C254A3A.title: "AC1.14 Horror Thriller Skull"
	quest.3C1026EF37C893CF.quest_desc: [
		"The power synthesizer is still too slow. It happens that the original version also has a synthesizer. Can it be connected to the Create logistics system?"
		""
		"&c Note: Although &f Niu Ye Ye is faster, it is quite troublesome to use and requires extensive experience to efficiently integrate it into the logistics system."
	]
	quest.3C1026EF37C893CF.title: "S4.10.2 Accelerates!"
	quest.3C2CEBF878AB2A20.quest_desc: [
		"The car is undoubtedly the most suitable physical structure for beginners. You only need to put stress on the wheels to run."
		""
		"In addition, the car is in direct contact with the ground and does not require strict center of gravity control - which also significantly reduces the difficulty."
		""
		"&aTips&r: In addition to tires, you can also install round things such as grinding wheels and flywheels on the suspension."
		""
		"&7This tutorial does not include pneumatic content"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"On how to turn:"
		""
		"&a [Recommended] &r method ①: Pass the redstone signal to the suspension and change the direction of the wheel."
		""
		"&a [Optional] &r Method ②: Control the speed difference between the left and right wheels to turn to the slower side."
		""
		"&7 Of course there are other ways, but I don’t recommend them, so I definitely won’t write about them."
	]
	quest.3C2CEBF878AB2A20.title: "Automobile"
	quest.3C537D53825E8207.quest_desc: ["{\"text\":\"Related additional information\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0E261EE5B5EA8F41\"}}"]
	quest.3C537D53825E8207.title: "H5.4.2 Mass-Producing...netherite? !"
	quest.3D641E50217E411F.quest_desc: ["It is usually used to synthesize iron backpacks in the early stage."]
	quest.3D641E50217E411F.title: "O2.6 Cheap Backpack"
	quest.3D7032A4AB2988DE.quest_desc: [
		"The drawer system can transport items wirelessly and in real time over a large area, and is sometimes better than a power arm."
		""
		"&aTips: &f can use upgrade plug-ins to expand the working range of the controller"
	]
	quest.3D7032A4AB2988DE.title: "S4.3.1 Wireless Drawer Transmission"
	quest.3D7B77FC4DA4A48F.quest_desc: [
		"The Exquisite Backpack is a frequent visitor to integration packs. It is a simple yet powerful backpack module."
		""
		"The backpack can be carried with you or equipped to the chest armor or back. Press the &eB&r key to quickly access the backpack."
	]
	quest.3D7B77FC4DA4A48F.title: "O2.5 Sophisticated Backpacks"
	quest.3D7E4FAEF34F3AA1.quest_desc: [
		"Whether smelted into ingots or washed into granules, processed minerals take up a lot of warehouse capacity."
		""
		"Packaging into mineral blocks for storage can greatly reduce storage pressure, and a power stamping machine combined with a work basin can meet this demand."
	]
	quest.3D7E4FAEF34F3AA1.title: "S2.10.1 Press Block Storage"
	quest.3D7E9E4911A60BF0.quest_desc: ["The Blaze Forge can combine multiple forging templates and apply forging templates to items"]
	quest.3D7E9E4911A60BF0.title: "E1.9 Living Anvil"
	quest.3E1685A174D77849.quest_desc: [
		"The two types of rice have different cultivation methods, and unfortunately, they are not interoperable. &7 (Considering whether to interoperate, or simply disable one?)"
		""
		"Rice from &e Farmer's Delight &r needs to be planted &e rice &r in &e one block of water &r soil &7 (or cultivated land, fertile soil, fertile cultivated land) &r."
		""
		"Can be harvested by right-clicking or using a powered harvester."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The rice from &e Kaleidoscope &r needs to be &e wild rice &r&7 (or rice, but the rice from Kaleidoscope has been Unified with Farmer Leshi's rice) &r is planted in &e one block of water &r in cultivated land &7 (or fertile cultivated land) &r."
		""
		"Right-clicking to harvest &e will not produce drops normally from &r, or using a power harvester to harvest can easily cause &e to freeze or crash &r."
		""
		"As compensation, the rice yield in Kaleidoscope is greater, and there is a chance of getting &e pig bug &r when harvesting. Feeding it to the chicken can make it grow up instantly."
		""
		"When there are &e fish &r in the water, the rice in Kaleidoscope will &e grow faster &r."
		""
		"The rice fields in Senra Monogatari will make frogs chirp."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The subtitle \"One integration package with 24 kinds of tomatoes\" refers to some shoddy integration packages &7&m (such as the one you are playing now) and &r that do not provide compatibility for items with the same name but from different modules."
		""
		"&7 is now done. If nothing else, you will see two identical rice in the task requirements."
		""
		"In fact, many excellent modules have long considered the possibility of having the same name, and have achieved partial interoperability through the tag system &7 (for example, anvil technology and Create are partially interoperable) &r."
		""
		"It's a pity that the tag system and synthesis formula of Kaleidoscope are not very well written, and I am too lazy to change them one by one."
		""
		"Open up!"
	]
	quest.3E1685A174D77849.quest_subtitle: "Isn’t it normal to have 24 kinds of tomatoes in one integrated package? (Eye shift)"
	quest.3E1685A174D77849.title: "F1.5 Rice"
	quest.3E539ED236EC7635.quest_desc: [
		"Boilers can provide a huge amount of stress, allowing you to get rid of the shackles of stress and freely design large machinery and production lines."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"▷Design fuel for your boiler to replenish &7 (recommended fuel: charcoal, magma, Blaze Cake)"
		""
		"▷Upgrade the boiler to full level &7 (level 18)"
		""
		"▷Design a boiler group &7 (multiple boilers connected together)"
	]
	quest.3E539ED236EC7635.title: "Boiler"
	quest.3EB2626D59177BE3.title: "Combat Components"
	quest.3EDB9250DFFFDC8A.quest_desc: [
		"Obtain it by smashing the &e charged &r neutron iron into the &e ember metal block &r in the &c over-temperature &r state."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The super-temperature ember metal block can only exist for 10 seconds, and there is a probability of degenerating into a nether alloy block after 10 seconds, so you need to be quick in this step"
	]
	quest.3EDB9250DFFFDC8A.quest_subtitle: "Steve's power!"
	quest.3EDB9250DFFFDC8A.title: "AC1.24 Ultimate Material"
	quest.3F198015065022AD.quest_desc: [
		"The steam boiler will empty the water from the tank every once in a while after it is started, so you need to continuously feed it with water."
		""
		"You can use the &e power pump &r and copper pipes to pump water directly from rivers, lakes and seas &7 (or even puddles) &r without having to use hose pulleys."
	]
	quest.3F198015065022AD.title: "2.2 Supply Water to the Boiler"
	quest.3F1D55B3D10C15A8.quest_desc: [
		"Tired of sorting and rummaging through boxes to find items? Try &eTom’s simple storage &r now!"
		""
		"Just take a look at &e Life Tips &r when you have the need. You don’t need to rush to read them all now, it will be very tiring."
	]
	quest.3F1D55B3D10C15A8.title: "Simple Warehouse Management"
	quest.3F4C4C22D05DE8A4.quest_desc: [
		"You can fish in crab pots because there are no crabs in MC ("
		""
		"Fishing nets are more efficient at catching fish, but require larger quantities."
	]
	quest.3F4C4C22D05DE8A4.quest_subtitle: "Did you win the Crab's resurrection match? If you win!"
	quest.3F4C4C22D05DE8A4.title: "F4.5 Automated Fishing"
	quest.3F5CFDE873518004.quest_desc: [
		"In the physical structure of aeronautics, &e weight &r is a very important concept, especially for ships and aircraft."
		""
		"In many cases, you need to use &e wooden boards &r, &e balloons &r, or even &e floating stones &r to reduce the weight of the physical structure."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Next is the &e volume &r. For beginners, the bigger the &e the better &r."
		""
		"Because miniaturization is more difficult than you think."
		""
		"Therefore, I strongly recommend that you build a larger &7 for your first work (unless you challenge building an aircraft from the beginning) &r."
	]
	quest.3F5CFDE873518004.title: "Volume and Weight"
	quest.3FFD00A21D5D5669.quest_desc: [
		"Using a rope pulley to move the power drill can easily dig out the mine, which is a good choice for early acquisition of minerals."
		""
		"See the Ponder scene for &e Rope Pulley &r for details."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Horizontal mining machine\",\"underlined\":true,\"color\":\"blue\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"263229837952BEAC\"}}"
	]
	quest.3FFD00A21D5D5669.quest_subtitle: "Remember to view the Ponder scene!"
	quest.3FFD00A21D5D5669.title: "S1.11.5 Simple Vertical Mining Machine"
	quest.3FFE5F7A41C3E51B.quest_desc: [
		"Many ingredients and raw materials need to be obtained from monsters."
		""
		"In addition, some ingredients can only be obtained by defeating creatures with &e knife &r/&e kitchen knife &r."
		""
		"&8This is a good reason for the chef god to come down to earthwww"
	]
	quest.3FFE5F7A41C3E51B.quest_subtitle: "\"The Stove Lord's Pioneer in a Different World\""
	quest.3FFE5F7A41C3E51B.title: "F4.1 Slaughter Hunt"
	quest.40B5D2A4D81DDEC9.quest_desc: ["If you're really too lazy to open a treasure house, that's not impossible..."]
	quest.40B5D2A4D81DDEC9.title: "Trade in Heavy Core"
	quest.40BD2A20316B98CC.quest_desc: [
		"&e cages &r are slightly more expensive, &e can only capture young creatures &r&7 (chickens and bees can be caught directly, other larger ones can only catch babies) &r, but fortunately &e can be used repeatedly &r."
		""
		"&e resin block &r is a one-time use of &e &r. It can capture &e with a larger range &r&7 (there are still size restrictions) &r. It can also capture &e's hostile creatures &r in a weak state. It is better to use, but you need &e crushing wheel &r or &e crushing table &r to make it."
	]
	quest.40BD2A20316B98CC.quest_subtitle: "\"Food: I Have a Ranch in Another World\""
	quest.40BD2A20316B98CC.title: "F2.1 Develop Animal Husbandry"
	quest.40EF2F8772FB09DF.quest_desc: [
		"Can store multiple variations of an item, such as an enchanted book."
		""
		"Not very useful."
	]
	quest.40EF2F8772FB09DF.title: "O4.10 Storage of Similar Items"
	quest.40F1C2E17AFC1657.quest_desc: [
		"Power plows can be used to plow the land, but it is obviously more convenient to plow the land manually &7 (chain plows can also be used for plowing the land) &r."
		""
		"But it can come in handy when you need a lot of dirt:"
		""
		"Dirt and gravel are mixed together to make sand, which turns into soil when cultivated with a hoe."
	]
	quest.40F1C2E17AFC1657.title: "F1.12 Automated Reclamation"
	quest.4100506A28411BB5.quest_desc: ["Usage similar to Create list filter"]
	quest.4100506A28411BB5.title: "O4.17 This Is the List Filter"
	quest.41207AC7A7FD17B3.quest_desc: [
		"First, you need to prepare a warehouse."
		""
		"Any container can be used in a warehouse, but I highly recommend an item vault."
	]
	quest.41207AC7A7FD17B3.title: "Storehouse"
	quest.4147FD563F5B8437.quest_desc: [
		"The power drill can destroy blocks in front of it, even obsidian."
		""
		"It is very suitable for use on the &e dynamic structure &r, see its Ponder scene for details."
	]
	quest.4147FD563F5B8437.title: "S1.7.2 A Drill Bit That Breaks Through the Sky!"
	quest.417DDED017FF632B.quest_desc: [
		"The teleportation stone disk &7 (assuming its number is A) &r is mainly used to transport organisms over long distances. After being placed, a &e resonance fragment &7 (numbered A) &r will be generated. Just plug the &e resonance fragment - A&r into other teleportation stone disks &7 (assuming the number is B) &r."
		""
		"&7If the resonance fragment is lost, insert &e sleep fragment &7 into the stone plate, and a resonance fragment with the same name as the teleportation stone plate will be generated again."
		""
		"When there is an entity &7 (such as a villager) &r above the &e teleportation stone plate-B&r, after a short forward shake, the entity will be teleported to the &e teleportation stone plate-A&r corresponding to the &e resonance fragment-A&r."
		""
		"&aTips&r: You can use it with the minecart assembly station to move the monster spawner home."
	]
	quest.417DDED017FF632B.title: "OS1.3.1 Waystone Disk"
	quest.41839730D89C3FA1.quest_desc: [
		"The uranium block turns into coarse uranium after time lapse and releases a lot of heat at the same time. You can use it to generate electricity."
		""
		"In addition, you can use mineral springs to obtain large amounts of uranium without having to occupy the collider all the time."
		""
		"&aTips&r: See the tutorial book for details"
	]
	quest.41839730D89C3FA1.title: "AC1.21.4 Mass-Producing of Uranium"
	quest.418B4F343AD328EA.quest_desc: [
		"As we all know, the next wreckage is rare, but since it is fireproof..."
		""
		"Wouldn’t it be better to dig out the entire magma lake? XD"
		""
		"&aTips&r: The wreckage has a replica formula &7 (using tungsten) &r, but it is recommended to enter the brass age before mass production."
	]
	quest.418B4F343AD328EA.title: "S1.8.5 Rare? It’s All Planed!"
	quest.41CCD0F9241BE346.quest_desc: [
		"The blender is really versatile, it can also make medicine!"
		""
		"Compared with the alchemy table, the mixer is faster and easy to automate"
		""
		"&7 Create Many resource regeneration requires potions, but you don’t necessarily need to do these things now"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You only need to fill the work basin with water, feed the blaze with fuel, and then put the ingredients in order to get the potion."
		""
		"The trouble is exporting the potion——"
		""
		"You can still use the &e open container &7 (introduced, I hope you haven’t forgotten) &f to export the brewed potion."
		""
		"However, starting from the crude medicinal solution, the product will be automatically exported at each step, making opening the container more complicated."
		""
		"Of course you can directly make extra long stairs, just like the original redstone alchemy machine. But I prefer to use smart fluid pipelines."
	]
	quest.41CCD0F9241BE346.quest_subtitle: "Please do not use cement work basins to fill potions!"
	quest.41CCD0F9241BE346.title: "S2.2.1 Bulk Refining Medicine"
	quest.41D3A1AE0002B54B.quest_desc: [
		"Farming can also be automated, but your needs should only be automatic preparation of soil and liquid fertilizer."
		""
		"If you are interested, check out the Ponder and automation chapters."
	]
	quest.41D3A1AE0002B54B.title: "F1.13 Automation"
	quest.4202A7B822717C80.quest_desc: [
		"Nature does not naturally generate core fragments or related minerals unless actively stimulated."
		""
		"Imitation may be a better option."
	]
	quest.4202A7B822717C80.title: "H5.4.3 Things That Do Not Exist in Nature"
	quest.4255BE43A79443AC.quest_desc: [
		"The high-temperature smelting of the AnvilCraft can produce two netherite fragments from one ancient wreckage, and one netherite fragment can be made into one ancient wreckage."
		""
		"This way you have unlimited netherite."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Remember to save a portion of the core, don’t use it all"
	]
	quest.4255BE43A79443AC.title: "AC1.19.1 Infinite Netherite"
	quest.4274FBFC68ACEB87.quest_desc: [
		"Forging upgrades can be performed in the Royal Forging Station without consuming templates."
		""
		"In addition, you can also make &e royal anvil &r and &e royal grinding wheel &r to further strengthen your weapons and equipment."
	]
	quest.4274FBFC68ACEB87.title: "S1.11.3 Save Forging Template"
	quest.429A59AB51756FCC.quest_desc: ["It would be nice to give me the extra diamonds, why do you do this?"]
	quest.429A59AB51756FCC.title: "O2.14 Is Not Needed"
	quest.438D5290BE258CBC.quest_desc: [
		"Can you imagine a world without meat, eggs, and milk?"
		""
		"It would be great to enclose a piece of land, raise small animals, and obtain delicious food and raw materials."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Taking advantage of the difference in size of juvenile and adult organisms &7 (F3+B can view the collision box) &r, you can use the &e Encased Fan &r with some blocks with special collision volumes &7 (such as the bottom of the cauldron, wool carpet, half brick, trap door...) &r to separate the cubs, thereby achieving automatic slaughter."
		""
		"&7Hmm...not very humane, it depends on your choice"
	]
	quest.438D5290BE258CBC.quest_subtitle: "Meat! Egg! Milk!"
	quest.438D5290BE258CBC.title: "F2.2 Ranch Prototype"
	quest.439FB931D388BDFB.quest_desc: [
		"The portal is close at hand..."
		""
		"What can't be found? Don’t forget to press F4 to get out of body"
	]
	quest.439FB931D388BDFB.title: "2.16 Open the Door at and Steve Will Give You Warmth."
	quest.43A0F994F8722DF4.quest_desc: ["overused"]
	quest.43A0F994F8722DF4.title: "O4.4 Beautiful Little Waste"
	quest.441B30BAB78F4D3E.quest_desc: [
		"Kaleidoscope: The tavern provides a brewing system to make up for the lack of table wine."
		""
		"But before you start, you need to find some winemaking ingredients: wheat, apples, berries and most importantly, grapes."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Grape Vines have Ponder scenes!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Grape vines are grown in:"
		"On the soil → purple grapes"
		"Magma Block→Golden Grape"
		"On ice → ice grapes"
	]
	quest.441B30BAB78F4D3E.title: "F3.3.1 Brewing Raw Materials"
	quest.448BA2E592AE59B4.quest_desc: ["The power arm can be bound to multiple blazes. It will be more convenient to feed the blazes with it."]
	quest.448BA2E592AE59B4.title: "H2.7 Feed the Blaze"
	quest.44989E6F78FFB9E5.quest_desc: [
		"Similar to iron, Create also has a way to mass-produce gold - but it is more difficult than mass-producing iron."
		""
		"Of course, if you follow the task line step by step, you will definitely be able to do it."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"The questline is here\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"469208ED7DC7B90E\"}}"
	]
	quest.44989E6F78FFB9E5.title: "S2.14.1 Unlimited Gold"
	quest.44E4DB19E314EABB.quest_desc: [
		"As we all know: when &9 water &r meets &4 magma &r, &e cobblestones &8 (or stones) will be generated."
		""
		"akin:"
		""
		"&9 chocolate &r meets &4 magma &r to generate &e slag &7 (producing charcoal and coal)"
		""
		"&9 honey &r meets &4 magma &r to generate &e limestone &7 (produce magma, or make volcanic ash)"
		""
		"&9 water&r meets &4molten gemstonestonestone&r and randomly generates &eandesite&r&7 (for andesite alloy)&r, &ediorite&r&7 (for zinc)&r, or &egranite&r&7 (for gold)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You may want to ask: Why wasn’t it said before that molten gemstonestonestones can produce granite?"
		""
		"Mainly I want you to taste the original synthetic formula, it is very delicious &8 (no)"
	]
	quest.44E4DB19E314EABB.title: "Stone Brushing Machine 2.0"
	quest.457937D43D028BF6.quest_desc: [
		"Mix the Frost Metal Block and the Ember Metal Block in Dragon Breath to obtain a multi-phase material, but the loss is relatively high..."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"resonator core\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7DF4BEFADBEB9ADF\"}}"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Heavy Halberd Core\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"10E3D0924F832EC6\"}}"
	]
	quest.457937D43D028BF6.title: "S2.17.6 Multifunctional Tool"
	quest.4691BD12327CDEB7.quest_desc: ["The wolf armor is a very OP piece of equipment, but it cannot be worn by humans."]
	quest.4691BD12327CDEB7.title: "H5.3.3 Shulker Farm Replacement"
	quest.469208ED7DC7B90E.quest_desc: [
		"At this point your gold production line is ready, the next step is to optimize logistics."
		""
		"For example: diverting cobblestone to the soul sand and red sand lines, using factory instruments to automate the production line, etc."
	]
	quest.469208ED7DC7B90E.title: "H3.8 You Did It!"
	quest.46B354A9BBAA036A.quest_desc: [
		"When the faucet from \"Jinzhi Decoration\" is attached to the &e water source &r (such as a water-bearing leaf) &r, it can continuously supply water without any consumption."
		""
		"Using it to supply water can eliminate the laborious manual pumping step after the boiler is shut down."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When attached to a container, it can also draw water out of the container and inject it into the container below."
		""
		"If you need to use a steam boiler in the Nether, a faucet can also help."
	]
	quest.46B354A9BBAA036A.title: "S2.2 Toothpick to Pry the Elephant"
	quest.46CCE67ABF227416.quest_desc: [
		"Entering the Bronze Age, steam boilers became the best source of stress."
		""
		"In many cases, a Class 9 boiler is enough to last you a lifetime, and the price is just some fuel, so why not?"
		""
		"&aTips: For the &f construction method, see Thoughts on the Steam Engine."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"In addition, the boiler is large and requires maintenance. Therefore, it is recommended that novice mechanics &7 (yes, that’s you) &r place the boiler in an open area."
		""
		"Then use the &e chain transmission wheel &r to connect the stress to your stress network in the Andesite Age - it is more convenient to maintain."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Boiler grade calculation method:"
		""
		"Dimensions: 1 level provided per 4 fluid tanks"
		""
		"Water volume: water supply per 10mb/s &7 (power pump speed per 20RPM) &r provides level 1"
		""
		"Heat: Each burning blaze chamber provides 1 level of &7 (super burning blaze chambers provide two levels) &r"
		""
		"Each level of boiler requires 1 steam engine, which can derive 16384su of stress."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Related Wikis\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.mcmod.cn/item/696090.html\"}}"
	]
	quest.46CCE67ABF227416.title: "2.1 Steam Boiler"
	quest.4716E23A66F62EE2.quest_desc: [
		"If you think netherite isn't enough..."
		""
		"Under super heating, using core fragments, nether alloy, magma, and blaze powder can further react to produce ember metal."
	]
	quest.4716E23A66F62EE2.title: "S2.6.7 Another Upgrade"
	quest.4792C0C9F0D5DF5E.quest_desc: [
		"The first step in mass production of frost alloy"
		""
		"But other than that, silver is useless."
	]
	quest.4792C0C9F0D5DF5E.title: "S2.2.6 Alchemy!"
	quest.4816843BD5B2FE89.quest_desc: ["Water channels and vanilla funnels still have their place in Create, don't forget about them"]
	quest.4816843BD5B2FE89.title: "S3.2.1 Old Skills Cannot Be Lost"
	quest.48B46D0ECFAD13D0.quest_desc: [
		"Although the performance overhead of the crane's dynamic structure is also small, it also has many special functions. But compared to other dynamic structures, it is much more complex."
		""
		"You can use wire control modules to reduce wiring difficulty."
	]
	quest.48B46D0ECFAD13D0.title: "S1.7.9 The Most Difficult Dynamic Structure to Use In"
	quest.498D6CAE7F0D43ED.quest_desc: [
		"Making a space overpressure device requires a lot of shulker boxes, so bring back some shells."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Use a brush to brush &e armadillo &r to quickly obtain armadillo shells"
	]
	quest.498D6CAE7F0D43ED.title: "AC1.20 Exploring the End"
	quest.49AA6727342CA7EB.quest_desc: [
		"Quartz sand can produce zinc after washing, and volcanic ash can produce copper, zinc, and iron after washing."
		""
		"In addition, by mixing volcanic ash and quartz sand with &e honey &r and &e corresponding color dyes &r, &e diabase &r and &e halite &r can be directly produced..."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Related additional information\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"44E4DB19E314EABB\"}}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You should have also noticed that iron and gold production can also be increased with honey——"
		""
		"Maybe the previous production line can be upgraded?"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7&m Originally, crushing tuff can produce four minerals: copper, zinc, iron, and gold, but I changed the formula."
		""
		"&7&mAfter all, the tuff that was originally non-renewable can now be regenerated, so it naturally requires some adjustments."
		""
		"Changed it back"
	]
	quest.49AA6727342CA7EB.quest_subtitle: "I think I can do it"
	quest.49AA6727342CA7EB.title: "S2.14.2 Mass-Producing of Copper and Zinc"
	quest.49BEAE6B58A06418.quest_desc: ["Normally this is not done. Elite monsters with backpacks will occasionally spawn in the wild, and their backpacks will have record upgrades."]
	quest.49BEAE6B58A06418.title: "O2.17 Random Refresh in the Wild"
	quest.49E985AF8A08783D.quest_desc: ["111"]
	quest.49E985AF8A08783D.title: "O3.12 Upgrade 3"
	quest.49F0BD005AF49BA8.quest_desc: [
		"Obviously it takes time for crops to grow, so rather than having the crane go back and forth all the time, it's better to start it at a scheduled time."
		""
		"&aTips&r: This component requires brass, you can modify your farm later"
	]
	quest.49F0BD005AF49BA8.title: "H1.7 Scheduled Round Trip"
	quest.49F272968741D3DD.quest_desc: [
		"The ejection storage platform can transport items in groups, and the wiring is relatively free."
		""
		"In addition, it can be placed between conveyor belts to allow scattered items to accumulate into a set of &7 (configurable) &r before being input to the conveyor belt."
		""
		"&8Stand up and try it yourself?"
	]
	quest.49F272968741D3DD.title: "3.3 \"air Freight\""
	quest.4A218D10EEB4096E.quest_desc: [
		"The &e dynamic structure &r introduced next is a major feature of Create, with which you can make many imaginative things."
		""
		"&e super glue &r can force multiple blocks together to form a huge dynamic structure. You need to make it first."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Remember to turn the page"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"If it is really inconvenient to make strong glue, you can first use some emergency blocks that can stick to each other without strong glue, such as mentioned in the task."
		""
		"However, no matter what, you always need strong glue, sooner or later you will have to do it."
		""
		"&7 I'm so happy, just make one, just make one"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"It doesn’t matter if you’re unlucky and can’t find slime."
		""
		"Create has added a synthetic formula for slime balls, please use JEI&7 (EMI) &r to check it out."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Or you can follow this quest\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"70B69557EC69A476\"}}"
	]
	quest.4A218D10EEB4096E.quest_subtitle: "Do this task first!"
	quest.4A218D10EEB4096E.title: "S1.7.1 Is Very Powerful."
	quest.4A371F65307F46FA.quest_desc: [
		"Rose Quartz, made by mixing quartz with redstone, is great for making electronic tubes, which can lead to smarter machines."
		""
		"However, rose quartz cannot be used directly. It must be polished with sandpaper first."
	]
	quest.4A371F65307F46FA.title: "2.3 Strawberry Flavored Lollipop"
	quest.4A4217E0399BAFB4.quest_desc: ["It no longer passes through the block and can be processed"]
	quest.4A4217E0399BAFB4.title: "AC1.22.1 Steady-State Neutron Bombardment"
	quest.4A42C3CC52E9DD9B.quest_desc: [
		"Cranes are also very suitable for managing farms. They can manage long slices of farmland or three-dimensional farmland (which is more complicated and does not need to be expanded)."
		"It should be noted that the dynamic structure of the crane cannot pass through the block, and the working range needs to be kept unobstructed"
	]
	quest.4A42C3CC52E9DD9B.title: "H1.4 Crane Farm"
	quest.4A4B02E72782E04B.quest_desc: ["Upgrade all your resonators, heavy halberds and a series of weapons and tools to over-the-limit levels"]
	quest.4A4B02E72782E04B.title: "AC1.26.1 Multiphase Ultralimit Alloy"
	quest.4A5694303D4111D3.quest_desc: ["Logistics operations in Andesite Times are limited, but with various containers &7 (such as large boxes, funnels) &r, many useful structures can be combined to achieve more complex functions."]
	quest.4A5694303D4111D3.title: "S3.4.1 Strange Skills and Tricks"
	quest.4A5F6F14E790FA8E.quest_desc: ["Here are some handy gadgets to make building physical structures easier for you."]
	quest.4A5F6F14E790FA8E.title: "Utility Tools"
	quest.4A6C41CA1B64E670.quest_desc: ["The same function as the storage agent, the difference is that it has no direction restrictions"]
	quest.4A6C41CA1B64E670.title: "O4.8 Universal Agent"
	quest.4ABD50F701E7028B.quest_desc: [
		"The chute of the AnvilCraft is more similar to the original hopper, but it can transport a group of items at a time, and it also comes with a 9-grid filter."
		""
		"&8 Unfortunately, the filter only has the whitelist &r"
	]
	quest.4ABD50F701E7028B.title: "AC1.4.1 AC1.4.1YetAnother Chute"
	quest.4B579F26CD36BE18.quest_desc: [
		"There are often multiple items mixed together in the production line. The original funnel sorting is quite inconvenient. Using a tool box can make sorting easier."
		""
		"In a single grid of the toolbox, even if the number of items &7 (assuming the name is item A) and &r is 0, it will always occupy &7 (only accepts item A and does not store other items) &r until you clear it manually."
		""
		"With the Andesite funnel for sorting, what can be stored will be taken away, and what cannot be stored will be left behind."
		""
		"It has 8 grids, which means that one tool box can sort 1 to 8 items."
	]
	quest.4B579F26CD36BE18.title: "3.5 Sorting"
	quest.4B739F8C258BD0C4.quest_desc: ["In AnvilCrafting, many templates require a villager to buy the first one, so the villager exchange has become a must."]
	quest.4B739F8C258BD0C4.title: "AC1.9 Village Exchange"
	quest.4BD59307EB5C3634.quest_desc: [
		"Crude oil can also be used to generate electricity, see the tutorial for details"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Even if you keep replenishing crude oil, crude oil will only burn for 10 minutes at a time, but you can throw high-temperature tungsten into the cauldron containing crude oil to ignite it again"
	]
	quest.4BD59307EB5C3634.title: "AC1.18.1 Oil and Electricity"
	quest.4BD7ABC1477AF18C.quest_desc: ["A capacitor can replenish 50% of the power of the float machine"]
	quest.4BD7ABC1477AF18C.title: "AC1.20.2 Battery Life"
	quest.4CE6FD6210F20209.quest_desc: [
		"out! nnd why not come out! Give it to me!"
		""
		"&aTips&r: The amethyst sword comes with decapitation enchantment. You can click on the amethyst sword in the reward to view the recipe."
	]
	quest.4CE6FD6210F20209.title: "S1.10.1 Decapitation Operation"
	quest.4D2314DA32426B80.quest_desc: [
		"Most crops can be harvested automatically with the &e power harvester &r."
		""
		"You only need to choose a &e dynamic structure &r you like, use &e super glue &r to stick the power harvester on the dynamic structure, and finally let the dynamic structure pass through the crops."
	]
	quest.4D2314DA32426B80.title: "F1.11 Automated Harvesting"
	quest.4D26957E0D0435EC.quest_desc: [
		"Copper can also be used to make equipment!"
		""
		"This set of diving equipment can consume the air in the &e back tank &r to support you breathing underwater."
		""
		"In addition, the copper boots can prevent the &e conveyor belt &r from transporting you away"
		""
		"&aTips&r: The optional sub-task means that you can receive the task reward without making a backpack."
		""
		"After all, the first few missions are for giving out benefits."
	]
	quest.4D26957E0D0435EC.title: "S1.3.4 Copper Diving Suit"
	quest.4D5DDEFA6A3A6697.quest_desc: [
		"The thickened version of the Shaft has basically the same effect during transmission."
		""
		"Although it is very mysterious, the crane Shaft in the charged state is indeed a stress transmission method in conjunction with the crane. This is surprisingly useful when deploying the &e smash wheel &r."
	]
	quest.4D5DDEFA6A3A6697.quest_subtitle: "Perverted niche ideas"
	quest.4D9D414F0BEFE6C5.quest_desc: [
		"Planting mushrooms on &e Fertile Soil &r can obtain colonies, which can be harvested with a power harvester."
		""
		"In addition, if you are in a hurry, you can also use liquid fertilizer injection to obtain mushrooms, and the cost is also very low."
	]
	quest.4D9D414F0BEFE6C5.quest_subtitle: "I'm not the god of medicine"
	quest.4D9D414F0BEFE6C5.title: "HS5.4.3.5 Injects Soul"
	quest.4DCED2C3B2C8D63A.quest_desc: ["This small crystal nucleus has the potential to grow into a complete wreckage, but how to make it grow?"]
	quest.4DCED2C3B2C8D63A.title: "S2.2.12 Mass-Producing of Netherite"
	quest.4DE6D8746807963A.quest_desc: [
		"hiss……"
		""
		"Have you been doing AnvilCrafting?"
	]
	quest.4DE6D8746807963A.title: "O2.15 Ultimate Dedication"
	quest.4DEE2D8CF9D0C8EA.quest_desc: ["The magnet upgrade of the Sophisticated Backpacks can collect specified items in a wide range, and it is also very suitable for use here."]
	quest.4DEE2D8CF9D0C8EA.title: "S2.11.3 Yes, This Is a Backpack"
	quest.4E02F938DE948035.quest_desc: [
		"&e tobacco bamboo &r will grow &e explosive pepper &r, which can be collected with &e knife &r, or can be automatically harvested with &e power arm &r."
		""
		"Both tobacco bamboo and chorus flowers can be harvested with the &e power saw &r."
		""
		"&7 I'm too lazy to write a detailed explanation, just search it yourself oao"
	]
	quest.4E02F938DE948035.title: "F1.6 If There Are Dates but There Are No Dates, Hit the Same Shot"
	quest.4E20BD5FFEB221D0.quest_desc: [
		"Same thing, you probably won't need it."
		""
		"Again, for symmetry, it appears here"
	]
	quest.4E20BD5FFEB221D0.quest_subtitle: "What are you for...?"
	quest.4E20BD5FFEB221D0.title: "S2.2.15 The Unexpected Products of Alchemy"
	quest.4E369AF79E286E91.quest_desc: ["Liquid experience can be stored in fluid storage tanks. Right-click the experience hatch to empty the experience on your body."]
	quest.4E369AF79E286E91.title: "E1.3 Storage Experience"
	quest.4E3CFC1C3EDC6E56.quest_desc: [
		"If you are bored, you can also try making some powerful weapons and tools."
		""
		"They come from AnvilCrafting, but I've written some recipes so you can make them directly with Create."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Use JEI&7 (EMI) &r to query the recipe."
		""
		"In fact, these things have been mentioned in the previous branches:"
		"{\"text\":\"royal steel\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3B6D08C930787F82\"}}"
		"{\"text\":\"Frost Metal Ingot\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"203380ED9BC38B15\"}}"
		"{\"text\":\"Ember Metal Ingot\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4716E23A66F62EE2\"}}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Looks like a lot of trouble to build? The final content will be a little more complicated..."
		""
		"What's more, the recipe for the AnvilCraft itself isn't that simple either."
		""
		"Of course, you can directly follow the technological line of AnvilCrafting and bypass Create to make it."
	]
	quest.4E3CFC1C3EDC6E56.title: "S2.17.5 The First Step in Creating an Artifact"
	quest.4E53611D08E4513D.quest_desc: [
		"Holding the &7 (or equipped) &r emerald amulet allows the villagers to give you a discount. As for how to obtain the amulet..."
		""
		"Holding an amulet box containing a totem of immortality has a chance to obtain the corresponding amulet when you die: P"
		""
		"In addition, I added some acquisition methods, you should be able to use JEI&7 (EMI) &r to view them."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Now hold a weapon &eenchanted with Looting&r and &8&mkill&r gently pat villagers; there is a chance they will drop an Emerald Amulet."
		""
		"The description of the &8&m talisman was added by me. It may be wrong. If you find it, you can ask me to change it."
		""
		"There used to be a separate page in the &8&m tutorial book to introduce the talisman, but it was locked by default and the description of the talisman was deleted."
		""
		"&8&mIt is not that the old description was patched up while the new one says nothing... let's just leave it here."
		""
		"&8 is all there, so I’d better delete them all."
	]
	quest.4E53611D08E4513D.title: "AC1.9.2 Fellow, Cheaper"
	quest.4E5F7465E4545CC9.quest_desc: [
		"The fluid drawer can store a large amount of fluid, and the stored liquid will be retained after excavation, which is quite convenient."
		""
		"Conservatives can do without the drawers, just use the minecart assembly station to move the fluid storage tanks away"
		""
		"&8It cannot replace fluid storage tanks to build steam boilers"
	]
	quest.4E5F7465E4545CC9.title: "S2.6.4 More Convenient Fluid Storage Tank"
	quest.4EFB4B43B0977EA5.quest_desc: ["Controllers and extenders can also have custom textures"]
	quest.4EFB4B43B0977EA5.title: "O3.8 Decorate It Too"
	quest.4F0981C6A7D6C9D5.quest_desc: [
		"Dynamic bearings will drive the structure to rotate after stress is applied, which is very suitable for building small tree farms and farms."
		""
		"The further away from the axis, the faster the linear speed and the higher the work efficiency of the workpiece... Wow!"
		""
		"The structure driven by Mechanical Bearings can pass through walls, and will squeeze out overlapping blocks when cubed, so you can also use it to destroy blocks cheaply and quickly."
	]
	quest.4F0981C6A7D6C9D5.title: "S1.7.10 It's Spinning!"
	quest.4F6BF99936ED5ACB.quest_desc: ["Redstone is used a lot, so this recipe is surprisingly useful."]
	quest.4F6BF99936ED5ACB.title: "S2.2.4 Mass-Producing of Redstone"
	quest.4F79E772A0B73E7A.quest_desc: ["The biggest difference is that you can transport a group of items at a time and you can use filtering, which is awesome"]
	quest.4F79E772A0B73E7A.title: "4.1 Gets an Upgrade!"
	quest.4F849B5CCEA84C30.quest_desc: [
		"Like the iron production line, the gold production line also starts with cobblestone."
		""
		"You can build a new stone brushing machine, or you can have the gold production line automatically pick up goods from the warehouse &7 (the stone brushing machine for the iron production line) &r."
	]
	quest.4F849B5CCEA84C30.title: "H3.1 Mass-Producing Cobblestone"
	quest.50815C1D74E30C19.quest_desc: [
		"The only aircraft that does not require fuel."
		""
		"The immersive aircraft also adds some airships and various upgrades. If you are interested, you can take a look."
		""
		"&aTips&r: JEI&7 (EMI) &r Search for \"&e@aircraft&r\" to view related content."
	]
	quest.50815C1D74E30C19.title: "O5.4 Beggar’s Edition Aircraft"
	quest.5094D6E28313B8AD.quest_desc: [
		"Using the Deployer, you can cram a ton of gears into such a small component, creating smarter machines."
		""
		"No matter how it is stuffed in, the power of &e Deployer is absolute!"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Remember to view the Deployer's Ponder scene &7 (here is mainly the third part) &r"
		""
		"&e sequence assembly &r means processing from left to right."
		""
		"It is recommended that you try to use methods such as &e conveyor belt &r to connect different links in series."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The Deployer is the nickname of the &e Deployer &r. Because the operation of the Deployer is very similar to that of the player, it can often produce incredible &8 (or is it ridiculous?) &r effects."
		""
		"The manufacturing process of precision components is called &e sequence assembly &r, which is a characteristic of Create."
		""
		"This package adds some interesting sequence assembly recipes based on the original Create. If you are interested, you can try it out."
	]
	quest.5094D6E28313B8AD.quest_subtitle: "The power of Deployer is absolute!"
	quest.5094D6E28313B8AD.title: "2.5 Subspace Compression Technology"
	quest.50DBE9905738208D.quest_desc: ["Brass funnels, smart chutes, and brass tunnels can all be set up for filtration. Let’s bid farewell to the retirement of the tool box."]
	quest.50DBE9905738208D.title: "4.5 Intelligent Filtering"
	quest.51305FC5A0A7542E.quest_desc: [
		"Items without a crushing formula will be directly worn when entering the crushing wheel. If conditions permit, filter teeth must be installed at the feed port!"
		""
		"Just put a &e attribute filter &r in the filter tank of &e brass funnel &r or &e smart chute &r."
	]
	quest.51305FC5A0A7542E.title: "！notice！"
	quest.518764631D4ECC3E.quest_desc: [
		"The compression upgrade from the Sophisticated Backpacks can quickly compress a variety of large amounts of items, and the backpack itself has a huge reserve. Although it is nondescript at the end of the production line, it is convenient."
		""
		"&8-Are you really a backpack?"
		""
		"&8-I think I am"
	]
	quest.518764631D4ECC3E.title: "S2.10.3 Are There Any Experts In ? !"
	quest.51D5A7E5C6A4D2E8.quest_desc: [
		"In addition to feeding the blaze directly, the magma can also be made into blaze cakes."
		""
		"The blaze who eats the blaze cake will enter the &e super combustion state &r, which can push the level of the steam boiler to level 18 &7 (although in most cases you cannot use up so much stress) &r."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"really simple\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5A05710292F49280\"}}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Mass production of Nether Rock is troublesome. A 24-hour Blaze Cake production line may not be a good idea. Try using the new logistics components of Create 6.0 to automatically produce on demand!"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Factory instrument\",\"underlined\":true,\"color\":\"blue\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"23636E72D5D35C87\"}}"
	]
	quest.51D5A7E5C6A4D2E8.quest_subtitle: "very simple"
	quest.51D5A7E5C6A4D2E8.title: "H2.6.2 Delicious Little Cakes"
	quest.5235B0EC83F33C50.quest_desc: ["By crushing minerals, defeating creatures with Deployer, etc., you can obtain experience particles, a convenient medium for storing experience. \"Create: Enchantment Industry\" has expanded a lot of gameplay in the experience mechanism. If you are interested, you can study it."]
	quest.5235B0EC83F33C50.title: "S2.4.2 Experience Particles"
	quest.5248106EB435E7D0.quest_desc: [
		"The end city has been renovated - bigger, stronger, and more loot!"
		""
		"End ships are also more likely to spawn, allowing you to obtain dragon heads and elytra more easily."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Firework rockets can also be mass-produced automatically."
		""
		"Try designing its production line and then connecting it to the logistics system?"
	]
	quest.5248106EB435E7D0.title: "S2.17.3 Mom, I Can Fly!"
	quest.525AD6D3FC562C55.quest_desc: [
		"Some advanced resources require collision to obtain. For this, you need a set of acceleration equipment and an explosion-proof collision room."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Please refer to the tutorial book for details on how to arrange the collision equipment."
		""
		"In addition, the power pole will stop after being charged by redstone, so you can turn off the acceleration device to free up power."
	]
	quest.525AD6D3FC562C55.title: "AC1.21.2 Art Is Explosion"
	quest.5288F7E78271279C.quest_desc: [
		"Netherrock is everywhere, and has the crafting recipe &7 (albeit a bit troublesome) &f."
		""
		"You're better off collecting a bunch at once and then not having to worry about it for a long time."
	]
	quest.5288F7E78271279C.quest_subtitle: "EZ！"
	quest.5288F7E78271279C.title: "H4.1 Is Everywhere"
	quest.529A777813CAC6FF.quest_desc: [
		"Create provides a lot of additional redstone components to help you better layout your lines."
		""
		"The redstone system is not required. But if you have more complex needs later, or want to automate cross-modules, don't forget them."
	]
	quest.529A777813CAC6FF.quest_subtitle: "Hey, it's me, Redstone System!"
	quest.529A777813CAC6FF.title: "S1.11.4 Miaomiao Gadget"
	quest.52B60DBE76B4794B.quest_desc: ["Similar to netherite, use a forge to upgrade items to the royalsteel version"]
	quest.52B60DBE76B4794B.title: "AC1.10 Gets an Upgrade!"
	quest.52D1638587ADF907.quest_desc: [
		"Power bearings and harvesters can automatically manage a circular farm, which is very convenient."
		"Although the Mechanical Bearing cannot contain water, the Shaft can"
		"If necessary, you can also stack Mechanical Bearings to make a wheat tower"
	]
	quest.52D1638587ADF907.title: "H1.3 Mechanical Bearing"
	quest.52F16F3FED5488ED.quest_desc: [
		"Now that the AnvilCraft is installed, you might as well give it a try. The tutorial book that comes with it is quite detailed."
		""
		"Similar to Create, holding the tutorial book and pressing &eCtrl&r can \"Ponder\" AnvilCraft items."
		""
		"In case you are dazzled, here is a main line for you, and you can slowly explore the side lines."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The content added by the AnvilCrafting can simplify many mechanically powered machines."
		""
		"Likewise, Create can simplify machines for AnvilCrafting."
		""
		"It is very suitable for practicing the ability to design machines across modules."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&7&mDid you know: AnvilCraft has a Ponder scene for making various items of your own!"
		""
		"It has been completed, but Gu Zhentian kept updating the AnvilCraft but did not update its Ponder scenes, which resulted in a BUG."
		""
		"What should I do? I can only obey."
	]
	quest.52F16F3FED5488ED.title: "AC1.1 Is Here"
	quest.5329D3AD8C264AAE.quest_desc: [
		"Take a chestnut - automatic crushing, I hope it can help you understand better."
		""
		"The tasks here do not require you to complete them. The arrows between tasks only indicate the connections between the blocks."
	]
	quest.5329D3AD8C264AAE.title: "Automation Example"
	quest.540E288CA40A579F.quest_desc: [
		"Treat the air in front of you as a container, and the dropped objects within this space will also be connected to the storage network &7 (dropped objects that have not been picked up for a long time will be automatically cleared by the game) &r."
		""
		"Correspondingly, the received items will be thrown forward."
	]
	quest.540E288CA40A579F.title: "O4.9 Open Box"
	quest.5428A8E531D969A5.quest_desc: [
		"When &e's enchanted &r eight-in-one forging template is destroyed &7 (it is recommended to use TNT to explode) &r, 4 of its own enchantments will be randomly selected to generate the corresponding forging template."
		""
		"If the four forging templates generated are different, an additional &e over-limit forging template &r will be generated."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Use the Ember Anvil to add unrelated enchantments to items."
		""
		"In addition, it is recommended to add &e15+&r enchantments to the eight-in-one template before drawing the over-limit template."
	]
	quest.5428A8E531D969A5.title: "AC1.25 Eight-in-One Forging Template"
	quest.544B8D112E834FEA.quest_desc: ["Move your mouse over the item icon to view the description"]
	quest.544B8D112E834FEA.title: "O3.10 Upgrade 1"
	quest.54953E46874B97F4.quest_desc: [
		"The food in Kaleidoscope has its own characteristics, and many foods have models that can be placed."
		""
		"Like Farmer's Delight pot, Kaleidoscope's pot also needs to be placed on the &e heat source &r to work."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When using the &e cutting board &r, place the &e ingredients in the off-hand &r, hold the kitchen knife &r in the main hand &e and continue to &e right-click &r to quickly cut vegetables."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When using &e soup pot &r, first pour in the &e soup base &7 (such as water) &r, then according to the recipe &7 (check JEI) &r, use the right mouse button &r to put in the appropriate amount of ingredients, &e cover the pot &r, and &e wait for the &r to complete cooking."
		""
		"After &e cooking is completed, &r open the lid and right-click the bowl to scoop out the food."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When using &e wok &r, first put &e grease &r, then according to the recipe &7 (check JEI) &r, use the right mouse button &r to put in the appropriate amount of ingredients, and then use the &e spatula &r right button to stir fry."
		""
		"After &e cooking is completed &r, use a bowl or rice to scoop out the food &7 as soon as possible (otherwise it will be mushy) &r."
	]
	quest.54953E46874B97F4.title: "F3.3 Kaleidoscope"
	quest.54B68217423D0972.quest_desc: ["With enchantment templates, you no longer need to make a bunch of diamond pickaxes, enchant them separately and knock them together with an anvil."]
	quest.54B68217423D0972.title: "E1.8 Template"
	quest.54FBCC6AA2A3DA2A.quest_desc: ["After connecting with the storage controller, the storage controller can be used as an agent to expand the effective range of the drawer system."]
	quest.54FBCC6AA2A3DA2A.title: "S2.12.4 Storage Expander"
	quest.5536784AB66FDC28.quest_desc: [
		"A regular workbench can't synthesize something as big as the Smash Wheel, so you'll need a larger, bulkier Power Synthesizer."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The stress consumed by 21 power synthesizers is not a small amount."
		""
		"If the stress is tight, you may wish to run the power synthesizer at extremely low speed."
	]
	quest.5536784AB66FDC28.title: "2.8 Mysterious Power Synthesizer"
	quest.553B73C3A38CC394.quest_desc: [
		"What should I do if I don’t have checkmark &7 (confirmation mark) &r?"
		""
		"In fact, you only need to click that √ to complete the task."
	]
	quest.553B73C3A38CC394.title: "Check Mark"
	quest.5548825817C0DF6C.quest_desc: [
		"A machine that can hover is very suitable for construction."
		""
		"But in most cases, blueprint cannons are used to build buildings."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"blueprint cannon\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6B151160907137A0\"}}"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Flying machine\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"30BE06340C85D4A6\"}}"
	]
	quest.5548825817C0DF6C.title: "O5.3 Construction Helper"
	quest.55DEC8C92162AD0E.quest_desc: [
		"Gem blocks &7 (usually emerald blocks) &r will turn into molten gemstonestones after being smelted"
		""
		"Throw a gem into the molten gemstonestone and then &e time shift &r to get a corresponding gem block"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Get emeralds in bulk\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2709CC4F17953FB8\"}}"
	]
	quest.55DEC8C92162AD0E.title: "AC1.16.2 Gem Transformation"
	quest.5616A7673F58B988.quest_desc: ["Use some means, such as a chute, to transport the items in the small warehouse into the crushing wheel"]
	quest.5616A7673F58B988.title: "Feed"
	quest.56357E854A76AA08.quest_desc: ["A very convenient source of fluids, the water generation upgrade also works in the Nether"]
	quest.56357E854A76AA08.title: "O3.18 Goodbye, Pointed Dripstone Cauldron"
	quest.565FC8E39E2DAD09.quest_desc: [
		"A workbench is built into the storage terminal."
		""
		"Can work with JEI&7 (EMI) &r."
	]
	quest.565FC8E39E2DAD09.title: "O4.3 Synthesis Terminal"
	quest.56BBF2993021E622.quest_desc: [
		"This package adds two main cooking modules, &e Farmer's Lay's &7 (and some of its accessories) &r and &e Kaleidoscope &r, each with its own characteristics:"
		""
		"Farmer's Lay's meals are rich in variety, relatively simple to make, and suitable for mass production. It mainly provides nutrition, and some dishes are made of synthetic ingredients."
		""
		"The food production in Kaleidoscope is relatively complicated, but more exquisite. Many dishes also provide powerful potion effects, suitable for consumption before heading out to explore."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Don’t forget, you can use JEI&7 (EMI) &r to check the recipes of various dishes"
	]
	quest.56BBF2993021E622.quest_subtitle: "\"Retired Mechanic's Restaurant in Another World\""
	quest.56BBF2993021E622.title: "F3.1 Delicious Food, at Your Fingertips"
	quest.5728E5DDFEC65C1B.quest_desc: ["Placing large item vaults under chutes so that they all lead to the same container is also a collection method"]
	quest.5728E5DDFEC65C1B.title: "S2.11.2 Large Size Containers"
	quest.5738B98A06AA37B3.quest_desc: [
		"Can absorb experience from nearby players and recover scattered experience particles."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The Deployer will drop experience particles when killing monsters. There is no need to use this to build a monster spawning tower."
	]
	quest.5738B98A06AA37B3.title: "E1.4 A Gadget"
	quest.57702AFB888B4828.quest_desc: ["The AnvilCraft adds some slide rails, similar to water channels, which can transport items in large quantities, but they are not so stuck."]
	quest.57702AFB888B4828.title: "S3.2.3 Ice Road"
	quest.57CC8596A6F452F1.quest_desc: ["Lava barrels are also a kind of fuel, and they can burn for a long time. They are very suitable for use as fuel for blazes. As for how to mass-produce them..."]
	quest.57CC8596A6F452F1.title: "S2.6.1 Mass Production Fuel-Lava"
	quest.57CE0B284AFB79CA.quest_desc: [
		"Compared with propellers, propellers are a rougher power source, characterized by their high power and the consumption of working fluid."
		""
		"Vector thrusters are a more advanced power source - mainly easier to control."
		""
		"Generating electricity is a troublesome task, so it is more recommended to use the &e liquid vector thruster &r."
		""
		"Finally, the &e creation vector thruster &r has a crafting recipe."
	]
	quest.57DD30E6D5A0F3F0.quest_desc: ["This part requires brass to make"]
	quest.57DD30E6D5A0F3F0.title: "Statement"
	quest.57E4FB9B8140169F.quest_desc: [
		"Ghasts are most commonly found in &e Soul Sand Canyon &r. It is recommended to bring &e Jetpack &r or &e Potato Cannon &r there."
		""
		"In addition, you can build a ghast monster spawning tower in the air of the Soul Sand Canyon, which only requires a &e Encased Fan &r and a &e dispersion net &r."
	]
	quest.57E4FB9B8140169F.title: "H5.5 Bulk Brewing"
	quest.581B7F6328943A77.quest_desc: [
		"The crushing wheel is an advanced version of the Millstone and can grind 64 parts of wheat at one time."
		""
		"You may not be able to do it now, come back and improve after you get brass."
	]
	quest.581B7F6328943A77.title: "H1.9 Crushing Wheel"
	quest.585E803B363CB5BB.quest_desc: [
		"&eDeployer&r&7 (Deployer)&r can fill buckets with milk, and using a milk bucket on a &eDepot&r will automatically pour the milk out."
		""
		"The creature &7 (cow) &r will always sit on the &e cushion &r after it comes into contact with it. You can also use a rope to forcefully tie the creature to the cushion."
		""
		"A small amount of automatic milking production line made by the hand of God can fill up your storage tank."
	]
	quest.585E803B363CB5BB.title: "F2.3 Endless Milk Source"
	quest.58DC2571CADB5D6B.quest_desc: [
		"The work basin will automatically transfer the product to the open container 1 block below the adjacent 4 blocks."
		""
		"As for what are open containers?"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"It is written here\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0F492741358DF5E0\"}}"
	]
	quest.58DC2571CADB5D6B.title: "S3.1.1 Automatedally Export Products"
	quest.59AFEFB4D426325F.quest_desc: ["Not bad, there are extra slots for you to bring"]
	quest.59AFEFB4D426325F.title: "O2.23 Is Made, I Guess You Are Not Used to It Either."
	quest.59DB538B35233DE2.quest_desc: [
		"Here are some milestone tasks that you can work towards when you don't know what to do."
		""
		"In addition to the basic content of the milestone tasks, you can also try to complete additional items. They will appear on the next page of the description &e&r starting with \"▷\", such as..."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"▷This is an add-on, you can try to complete it"
		""
		"▷This is also an additional item, usually the more difficult it is as you go down."
		""
		"▷Try to complete additional items, which may improve your Create level"
	]
	quest.59DB538B35233DE2.quest_subtitle: "[WIP] means unfinished"
	quest.59DB538B35233DE2.title: "The Beginning of Everything"
	quest.59EE3CF0ABCE9FEE.quest_desc: [
		"Although it's called a potato cannon, it can do more than just shoot potatoes."
		""
		"Launching different vegetables has different effects"
		""
		"&7 can not only launch vegetables, you can also launch fish, flaming cakes..."
	]
	quest.59EE3CF0ABCE9FEE.title: "F1.14 Hot Weapon Era!"
	quest.5A0138E038698FF4.quest_desc: [
		"clutch:"
		""
		"Cut off stress when receiving a redstone signal, used in &e to cut stress network &r."
		""
		"You can separate fragile machines &7 (such as boilers) &r, and uncommon but necessary machines &7 (power synthesizers) &r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Counter-rotating gearbox:"
		""
		"Changes the direction of rotation when receiving a redstone signal, usually used with the &e dynamic structure &r."
		""
		"If you just want to change the direction of rotation, you can directly use the &e cross gearbox &r."
		""
		"&7Don't worry, there is a reversal! # Connect to redstone signal"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Adjustable chain gearbox:"
		""
		"Allows the redstone signal to control the speed, usually used with the &e dynamic structure &r."
	]
	quest.5A0138E038698FF4.quest_subtitle: "Simple and basic functions are the cornerstone of complex functions"
	quest.5A0138E038698FF4.title: "Redstone Control"
	quest.5A05710292F49280.quest_desc: [
		"Finally, pour lava into the cake embryo, and the small cake prepared for the Blaze is complete!"
		""
		"Consider integrating it into your logistics system?"
	]
	quest.5A05710292F49280.title: "H4.4 Delicious Small Cakes"
	quest.5A620F05AAD3F8A5.quest_desc: ["You can throw the package out by right-clicking it. Can you develop some entertainment activities?"]
	quest.5A620F05AAD3F8A5.title: "A2.12.1 Slam Dunk"
	quest.5A83C7FC4C384938.quest_desc: [
		"Put a notice board on the &c baler &r and write the address on it, so that the package will be automatically transported to the corresponding frog port by the chain transmission wheel."
		"For example, here, there is a \"warehouse\" written on the notice board. After the package is hung on the chain by Wagang, it will be automatically transported to the Wagang named \"Warehouse\"."
	]
	quest.5A83C7FC4C384938.title: "Guide the Way"
	quest.5A9DDD662F61550D.quest_desc: [
		"The royal anvil will not break, nor will it strike you as too expensive when merging enchantments &8 (but you probably can't afford the expensive experience) &r"
		""
		"The royal grinding wheel can remove curses and enchantment penalties, and get &e curse gold &r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"[ \"Obviously using an anvil requires a lot of experience, you may need to do it\", { \"text\": \"\"Create: Enchanting Industry\"\", \"color\": blue, \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"30DA2989D5BB1C21\" } }, \"Related content.\" ]"
		""
		"Or you can convert excess lapis lazuli into &e experience particles &r, and the yield is not low."
	]
	quest.5A9DDD662F61550D.title: "AC1.13 Royal Anvil and Royal Grinding Wheel"
	quest.5ABB862DDC32F580.quest_desc: ["The second one is placed in the work area, such as near the grinding wheel"]
	quest.5AC2947140295B05.quest_desc: [
		"Use sprinklers and injectors to remove liquids with high efficiency."
		""
		"Similarly, you can use a dispensing tank to pour the liquid back"
	]
	quest.5AC2947140295B05.quest_subtitle: "Pour the liquid in..."
	quest.5AC2947140295B05.title: "S2.2.16 Take Out the Potion..."
	quest.5AF27B54E33991CF.quest_desc: [
		"Put &e zinc &r and &e copper &r into a power blender and feed the blaze &e fuel &7 (such as coal) &r to make brass."
		""
		"It's time to start a new chapter!"
		""
		"&aTips&r: The next task description will be shorter and shorter, don’t forget you can use &eJEI&7 (EMI) &r to view the recipe"
	]
	quest.5AF27B54E33991CF.title: "1.11 Brass!"
	quest.5B26BC7019FB483C.quest_desc: [
		"The &e portable engine &r is a very convenient stress source, from the &e Create: aeronautical &r, designed for use in aircraft or automobiles."
		""
		"Although it is not very efficient, it is enough for your early use."
	]
	quest.5B26BC7019FB483C.title: "A1.6.2 Portable Engine"
	quest.5B63C5D6D8BF040D.quest_desc: ["The power arm can transport items in groups, and the restrictions are quite small, making it difficult to be disturbed."]
	quest.5B63C5D6D8BF040D.title: "4.3 Three-Dimensional Transportation"
	quest.5B74744EE5D552DC.quest_desc: ["Similar to synthetic upgrade, but there is not much need to carry it with you"]
	quest.5B74744EE5D552DC.title: "O2.18 Is Somewhat Useful, but Not Much"
	quest.5B7CAF6382995374.quest_desc: ["The compression drawer from \"Functional Storage\" can automatically compress and store items, and can directly take out blocks, ingots, and grains &7 (without manual synthesis) &r, which is very convenient"]
	quest.5B7CAF6382995374.title: "S2.10.2 A More Convenient Option"
	quest.5BA98A1B2E5358F3.quest_desc: [
