	quest.5F052C4E1F23717A.quest_desc: [
		"In addition to portable engines, there are some advanced stressors."
		""
		"&e Stirling engine &r can produce 4096su stress at the speed of &e256&rRPM."
		""
		"The two &e compression engines, &r, can produce 8192su stress without fuel, but the speed is 16RPM."
		""
		"If your structure requires huge amounts of stress, don't forget the &e boiler &7 (steam engine) &r - ​​each level of boiler can derive stresses of &e16384&rsu."
		""
		"&7 liquid burner is not easy to use"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Finally, the &e creation motor &r has a synthetic formula, which is sure to meet your stress needs."
	]
	quest.5F052C4E1F23717A.title: "More Portable Stress Sources"
	quest.5F14E48DD9F87225.quest_desc: [
