	quest.5F91CA3FD1CD4D40.quest_desc: [
		"The Encased Fan can blow entities &7 (such as &8&m annoying &r&7 villagers) &r, and can also wash, smelt, smoke, and haunt souls in batches, which is very practical"
		""
		"&aTips: &f The wind fields of multiple Encased Fans can be superimposed, thereby improving processing efficiency &7 (processing efficiency has nothing to do with the Encased Fan speed) &r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"A simple example of 4x wind field superposition:"
		"- Objects falling on some highly special blocks &7 (such as Blaze combustion chambers, metal beams, power harvesters, etc.) will be stuck in the middle of the upper and lower grids, and will be processed by the upper and lower processing wind fields at the same time."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/encased_fan_eg.png width:128 height:71 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"In addition, the Encased Fan can blow away falling objects."
		""
		"Pay attention to how many spaces the items will be blown away during processing. Place a funnel at the end to achieve automatic collection."
		""
		"Once again, it is emphasized that processing efficiency has nothing to do with Encased Fan speed!"
	]
	quest.5F91CA3FD1CD4D40.quest_subtitle: "799~Huhuhu~"
	quest.5F91CA3FD1CD4D40.title: "S1.7.6 Wind Rider"
	quest.603B57082D2B7448.quest_desc: [
