	quest.615941A4754A7287.quest_desc: [
		"Import cobblestone and quartz into the &e power synthesizer &r to automatically create &e diorite &r."
		""
		"The efficiency of a single power synthesizer is still too low. You can try stacking multiple power synthesizers together and feeding them in batches."
