	quest.63F4051821289588.quest_desc: [
		"&cBefore we begin&r: please don't skip quest descriptions just to grab the rewards. If you do, I reserve the right to fill your backpack with assorted suspicious food."
		""
		"Create can look intimidating at first, but it starts to make sense once you actually build with it. Enough talking: jump in, try things, and let the machines teach you."
		""
		"&aTranslation note&r: this English quest text was translated and polished with AI assistance. If you are a native English speaker and can improve the wording, better translations are very welcome. Contact details will be added after the project is published on GitHub."
		""
		"&aTips&r: some quests have multiple pages. Click the arrow in the lower-right corner to keep reading."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Nice, you found the next page. &7# applause"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Yep, that's the idea."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"That's all. No more pages, really."
	]
