	quest.644E9D3E4DFC15BC.quest_desc: [
		"The mission system is this interface!"
		""
		"In addition to opening with the task book, after pressing E to open the backpack, &r has many small tools in the upper left corner of the entire &e screen. Among them, there is a small shortcut icon for the task book. Click it to open this interface."
		""
		"Move the mouse to &r on the far left side of the &e task interface. You can see many chapters, which are classified various guided tasks. When you don’t know what to do, just follow the tasks."
	]
	quest.644E9D3E4DFC15BC.title: "How to Use the Task System?"
	quest.6458C6BDA6F72ED6.quest_desc: [
		"The physical structure of aeronautics is still a long way from being able to drive a vehicle."
		""
		"After building the shell, you need to apply stress to the &e equipment &7 (wheels, propellers...) &r so that they can work."
		""
		"&e portable engine &r is a stress source specially prepared for limited space, which is convenient and fast."
		""
		"Other stress sources are left to you to explore freely without introducing too much."
		""
		"&aTips&r: If you really want to, you can use waterwheels, windmills, boilers, etc."
	]
	quest.6458C6BDA6F72ED6.quest_subtitle: "stress source"
	quest.6458C6BDA6F72ED6.title: "General Knowledge"
	quest.64595B1A54501FB3.quest_desc: [
		"In the upper right corner of the &e mission interface, &r has a one-click function to receive mission rewards. You don’t need to click on each one manually."
		""
		"When using this feature, make sure there is a box nearby to store a large amount of miscellaneous mission rewards."
	]
	quest.64595B1A54501FB3.title: "Get It with One Click"
	quest.646D0951BFFCE244.quest_desc: [
		"Excess seeds can be squeezed for oil, which has many benefits:"
		""
		"First of all, both seed oil and oil residue can be used as fuel, and the burning time of seed oil is very long &7 (I originally wanted to design that seed oil can make the flames' combustion chamber enter super combustion, but it is a pity that the code did not run)"
		""
		"In addition, the oil residue can be used to make &e organic fertilizer &r, and then mixed with water to make &e liquid fertilizer &r"
		""
		"Finally, the seed oil can be mixed with cream or butter to make &e grease &7 (for cooking)"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"It is designed for no other purpose than to use up excess vegetables, seeds, etc."
		""
		"The item labeling system in Kaleidoscope is a complete mess, and it’s annoying as hell."
	]
	quest.646D0951BFFCE244.title: "F1.3 Oil Extraction"
