	]
	quest.67B6BB4332CCECAE.title: "Cache"
	quest.67F4721322D79770.quest_desc: [
		"Now, press \"&eT&r\" to open the chat box, and the input method will be automatically switched."
		"&7-has a certain performance impact, but it can solve the dilemma of novice card input methods."
		"&7 - Disable IMBlocker if you don't need it"
		""
		"In the &e synthesis interface &r, press \"&eTab&r\" to automatically repeat the synthesis formula you used last time."
		""
		"In the &e task interface &r press \"&eCtrl&r + &eF&r\" to search for tasks."
		""
		"MC defaults to &eCtrl&r sprinting and &eShift&r sneaking."
		""
		"If you encounter a button that does not respond when pressed, or if you want to change the default settings, please follow the steps of &r on the next page of &e to open the button configuration page:"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"①Press &eEsc&r to open the menu and find \"&e option...&r\""
		""
		"② Find \"&e button control...&r\" in \"&e options...&r\""
		""
		"③Find “&e key binding…&r” in “&e key control…&r”"
		""
		"④Search for the key you need to check in the search box at the top of the \"&e Key Binding...&r\" page. Here's how:"
		""
		"&ecategory:&r+&eModule name&r——View all button functions of the specified module"
		""
		"&ekey:&r+&eKey name &r——View all binding items of the specified key"
		""
		"&ename:&r+&e Function name &r - Check the key binding of a certain function"
	]
	quest.67F4721322D79770.title: "Some Fragmentary Information"
	quest.68730811F19FBB0B.quest_desc: [
		"Who doesn’t want a TBM that can be driven out for a walk &7(?)&r!"
		""
		"In the Ponder scenes for the &e physical assembler &r and the &e boring head bearing &r there is the knowledge required to build a shield machine."
		""
		"It's cumbersome, inefficient, and difficult to control... but fun enough."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Using conveyor belts as crawlers is a very economical choice, but turning and going uphill will be very troublesome, so it is recommended to use wheels."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"If you really want to use crawler tracks, search for \"&e@track&r\" in JEI&7 (EMI) &r to see the content of &e Create: Track &r - various crawler tracks and suspensions"
