	]
	quest.6994597220DA39DA.title: "S2.12.2 Gets an Upgrade"
	quest.69D8C4A7A0F6E3C6.quest_desc: [
		"Use the spatula to right-click &e to open the enamel basin &r. You can scoop a spoonful of fat from it and pour it directly into the pot for cooking."
		""
		"The cook's stool is a stepping block that makes it easier for you to operate woks and soup pots."
		""
		"The oil pot can hold seed oil and is used to replace fat for cooking."
	]
	quest.69D8C4A7A0F6E3C6.title: "F3.5 Practical kitchenware(2)"
	quest.69DD7EFEEBE25791.quest_desc: ["&e crushing wheel &r crushing blaze rod can produce more blaze powder"]
	quest.69DD7EFEEBE25791.title: "S2.2.2 More Flame Powder"
	quest.69FBB054877310A4.quest_desc: [
		"What should I do after defeating Wither, get a max level beacon?"
		""
		"&7 can also make floating frost metal ingots!"
	]
	quest.69FBB054877310A4.title: "S1.10.2 Nether Star"
	quest.6A0BC46E8A670AF7.quest_desc: [
		"Uranium can generate electricity, without &7 (not) &r."
		""
		"You probably won't need it, but it's here for symmetry."
	]
	quest.6A0BC46E8A670AF7.title: "S2.2.14 Hazardous Metals"
	quest.6A1DFA5CB68B840B.quest_desc: [
		"Heliostats are used to collect sunlight to heat the tungsten block, and then generate electricity through a collector. The amount of electricity generated is not small."
		""
		"However, the shortcomings are also obvious. It occupies a huge area and requires sunlight."
	]
	quest.6A1DFA5CB68B840B.title: "AC1.7.1 Solar Thermal Power Station"
	quest.6A395F0A533BBFA6.quest_desc: [
		"When querying recipes through JEI&7 (EMI) &r, you should have noticed that many Farmer's Delight dishes can be automatically cooked using mechanically powered workpieces &e."
		""
		"Although the food in Kaleidoscope cannot be made directly with mechanically powered workpieces, the power of Deployer &7 (manipulator) &r is absolutely &r——"
		""
		"It is still feasible to use a Deployer to simulate manual cooking steps, but it is more complicated."
		""
		"Maybe you could open a huge pub or restaurant later?"
	]
	quest.6A395F0A533BBFA6.title: "F3.6 Automated Cooking"
	quest.6A4AE77D81ABAFD9.quest_desc: [
		"After the overall structure is completed, you may also need to use flint blocks &7 (waste recycling) &e heavier blocks &r like &e as counterweights &r to adjust the center of gravity &r."
		""
		"Use the &e structural diagram &r to view the stress and center of gravity of the physical structure."
		""
		"Be sure to ensure that the center of gravity of your work is not too biased, and that the overall force is not too biased - unless you know exactly what you want to do."
		""
		"&aTips&r: There is a gyroscope that comes with the module. It only needs to introduce enough stress to maintain structural stability."
		""
		"This is a guaranteed one-size-fits-all solution, and I hope you won’t rely too much on it."
	]
	quest.6A4AE77D81ABAFD9.title: "Balance Control"
	quest.6A667E59BF39167F.quest_desc: [
		"At its most basic, the blueprint cannon can help you quickly expand your platform, deploy machines, and build mansions"
		""
		"In addition, the blueprint cannon has many advanced functions, such as helping you prepare the land:"
		""
		"Enable the air replacement function in the settings in the lower left corner of the blueprint cannon, and then print a blueprint full of air."
		""
		"Covered blocks are not returned to you. Additionally, having multiple Blueprint Cannons active at the same time increases efficiency."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"It's painful to rummage through boxes and cabinets to find materials. Try throwing the clipboard into the blueprint cannon &7 (it will become a material list) &r, and then take it to the warehouse manager &7 (see the Ponder scene for the warehouse transmitter) &r to quickly prepare materials."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Shift+right-click and place the backpack next to the blueprint cannon, and the blueprint cannon can automatically take items from the backpack"
	]
	quest.6A667E59BF39167F.title: "Copy Paste"
	quest.6A945F2BC97B33DE.quest_desc: [
		"When Deployer kills a creature, experience particles are usually produced."
		""
		"Combined with the monster spawning tower, you will have an endless stream of experience."
	]
	quest.6A945F2BC97B33DE.title: "ES1.2.1 Execution by the Deployer"
	quest.6B0E81A5DD26BBBC.quest_desc: ["Use it to bind the storage connector to remotely access your warehouse."]
	quest.6B0E81A5DD26BBBC.title: "O4.6 The Great Success of Magical Skills"
	quest.6B151160907137A0.quest_desc: [
		"The Little Black Tower is a relatively troublesome machine. Using the blueprint system can greatly reduce the workload. Go and try it."
		""
		"&aTips: When &f holds a blueprint to deploy a building, Shift+right click can fill in the specific coordinates."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Put &e clipboard &r into the blueprint cannon to get a material list to facilitate your preparation of materials."
		""
		"You can directly give the material list to &e warehouse manager &7 (warehousing transmitter) &r, and intelligently sort the materials directly from the warehouse."
	]
	quest.6B151160907137A0.title: "S2.17.2 Fire!"
	quest.6B58E7363BD4E0F4.quest_desc: [
		"What will happen if something that cannot be crushed is caught in the crushing wheel?"
		""
		"Destroy it directly!"
		""
		"Quickly use the attribute filter, use coarse ore as a reference, add the entry \"&e can be crushed &r\" and stuff it into the entrance of the crushing wheel to save every person who has lost their footing."
	]
	quest.6B58E7363BD4E0F4.title: "S2.9.3 Goudi Review!"
	quest.6B622E9F4CE8D0A8.quest_desc: ["Use the ax to right-click the log to peel it. Then right-click the log with &e to peel the log &r and get the Andesite case."]
	quest.6B622E9F4CE8D0A8.title: "1.5 Sets of Shells!"
	quest.6B6979B9E5EB8248.quest_desc: [
		"A jetpack can give you a near-creative experience of flying, but it’s cumbersome to make."
		""
		"It must not be a problem for you, right?"
		""
		"&aTips&r: You can also search for \"&e quadcopter &r\" by JEI&7 (EMI) &r, which is a low-profile alternative to the jetpack."
		""
		"In addition, the formula of &e jewelry processing station &r is a copy formula. It is recommended that you use sequence processing for the first feather amulet."
	]
	quest.6B6979B9E5EB8248.title: "S2.8.2 Flying"
	quest.6B9FF06416BDA640.quest_desc: [
		"Throw the geode onto &e stamping platform &r, use an anvil to smash it &8 (or left-click anvil hammer) &r, and get three kinds of gems"
		""
		"&aTips&r: The anvil will not break if it falls 1 square."
	]
	quest.6B9FF06416BDA640.quest_subtitle: "Power stamping machine:?"
	quest.6B9FF06416BDA640.title: "AC1.4 AC1.4Keng!"
	quest.6BCAC18D81E9476D.quest_desc: [
		"Most Create components include \"&ePonder&r\": a complete set of animated tutorials."
		""
		"All you need to do is open your backpack, move your mouse cursor to an item you don't know how to use, and hold down [&eW&r] to Ponder."
		""
		"If you still have questions or need inspiration, you can also check out the Create tutorials I did before :)"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Click here to view the tutorial\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gCNkeGEJR/\"}}"
		""
