	quest.6E68235AA84E758D.title: "Control System"
	quest.6E98B59A5D229C20.quest_desc: [
		"The rope pulley is very suitable for driving the &e power drill bit &r, which can dig all the way to the bedrock layer."
		""
		"When the rope pulley &e stops moving &r, the rope can also be used as a ladder to help you climb back to the surface quickly."
		""
		"&aTips&r："
		""
		"When there is &e storage block &r in the dynamic structure, the produced items will be automatically stored in it;"
		""
		"In addition, the item vault cannot be opened directly. It is not a BUG. Remember to view its Ponder scene."
	]
	quest.6E98B59A5D229C20.title: "S1.7.7 Journey to the Center of the Earth"
	quest.6F187E2EE4C10CAB.quest_desc: [
		"For the &e airship &7 (or hot air balloon?) &r, the basis for lift-off is the airbag, and it is best to make it larger."
		""
		"As the altitude increases, the air pressure decreases, and the lift produced by the air bag also decreases."
		""
		"For the &e ship &r, the buoyancy depends on the displacement - although it does not actually displace the water."
		""
		"As for the &e aircraft &r, it mainly generates lift through sails."
	]
	quest.6F187E2EE4C10CAB.title: "Lift/Buoyancy"
	quest.6FA194138A172530.quest_desc: [
		"Crush netherite to obtain ember flour, which can be used to make blaze cake embryos."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Nether dust can also be obtained by using an AnvilCrafting grinding table. Nether dust can be ground to produce more ember flour."
		""
		"Ember flour can also be reversely crafted into nether dust."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The following is an abandoned manuscript. I am used to keeping abandoned cases because I have suffered losses oao"
		""
		"&mCrush nether rock to obtain nether dust. Crush it again to obtain ember flour to make Blaze Cake embryos."
		""
		"&m In the original Create, after the nether rock is crushed, ember flour will be obtained directly. I have modified the formula here without permission - because nether dust is useful."
		""
		"&mTo compensate, I increased the yield of Ember Flour"
		""
		"&m Obviously the teaching package should not modify the content of the original process. Unfortunately, I have not come up with any good formula to be compatible with the anvil process."
		""
		"If you have a good idea, you are welcome to suggest modifications"
	]
	quest.6FA194138A172530.title: "H4.2 Grinding Powder"
	quest.700C61FA7B245F9C.quest_desc: [
		"Zombies standing in the beam of the corrupted beacon will turn into giants. If &e zombies &r are stuffed with anvils &7 in advance (right-click the zombies with anvils, it is recommended to stuff 20 at one time) &r, the transformed giants may hold a giant anvil."
		""
		"&aTips&r: If there is a block above the corruption beacon, it will not produce a light beam. The light beam can pass through glass, bedrock, &e hollow magnet block &r"
	]
	quest.700C61FA7B245F9C.title: "AC1.17 Biotechnology"
	quest.705A40C192CC3B85.quest_desc: [
		"Like netherite, you need a forge template to upgrade tools to the royalsteel version."
		""
		"The royal steel forging template can be found in the box in the blacksmith shop, or can be obtained by trading with &e jeweler &7 (unemployed villagers will become jewelers after approaching the jewelry processing table) &r."
		""
		"&aTips&r: It is recommended to build a villager breeding center and villager exchange."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"By the way:"
		"The villagers don't start work until 8 o'clock, but Steve &7 (you) &r gets up at 6 o'clock."
		""
		"Related tutorials:"
		"{\"text\":\"Village Breeding Center\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91?variant=zh-cn#%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%8E%E5%BA%8A\"}}"
		"{\"text\":\"It is also recommended to read the Wiki\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%9D%91%E6%B0%91?variant=zh-cn\"}}"
	]
	quest.705A40C192CC3B85.title: "S1.11.2 Upgrade Template"
	quest.70A75AECE5AFE291.quest_desc: ["The best backpack in MC, it will accompany you till eternity"]
	quest.70A75AECE5AFE291.title: "O2.10 Ultimate Dedication"
	quest.70B69557EC69A476.quest_desc: [
		"The Millstone can grind wheat and obtain wheat flour, thus improving the utilization rate of wheat."
		""
		"It’s still too slow to grind wheat one plant at a time. More efficient machines will be available in the future."
	]
	quest.70B69557EC69A476.title: "S1.7.5 Is Small and Beautiful"
	quest.70FA30FEA136BF9E.quest_desc: [
		"The boiler will definitely not be able to digest all the charcoal, so just transport the excess back to the warehouse!"
		""
		"A simple way:"
		""
		"The &e conveyor belt &r is directly connected to the warehouse. The wooden barrels for storing coal for the boiler are connected to both sides of the &e conveyor belt &r from &7 to the warehouse. &e Andesite/brass funnel &r is used to take out the materials."
		""
		"In this way, when the barrel is full, the funnel will not take the material from the conveyor belt, and the charcoal will naturally enter the warehouse."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You ask me what the stock converter here is for?"
		""
		"In fact, &7 is not used for the time being (or in other words, I hope you use it)."
		""
		"Or you could use it to check if the warehouse is full and shut down the tree farm?"
	]
	quest.70FA30FEA136BF9E.title: "H2.8 Shunt"
	quest.712EF7E4583780CC.quest_desc: ["In addition to being smelted in batches, the crushed ore can also be washed in batches to obtain &e as an additional by-product &r."]
	quest.712EF7E4583780CC.title: "2.10 Crushed Ore"
	quest.714DFF8B1435B67B.quest_desc: [
		"The amount of iron used is quite large. You should make a &e iron production line &r. Let’s start with the &e stone brushing machine &r!"
		""
		"You must have noticed that after washing &e with gravel &r&7 (see the Ponder scene for the Encased Fan) &r, there is a probability of obtaining &e iron particles &r, and gravel can be obtained by crushing cobblestones."
		""
		"A simple stone brushing machine can provide a continuous supply of cobblestone, which means that Create can produce iron in large quantities."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"I thought that mass production of iron is a compulsory content, so I put it in the main line ("
		""
		"The task given by &etask screen&r is used to automatically submit the task. Of course, it is not necessary."
		""
		"&cBreakNews！"
		""
		"Now the cobblestones destroyed by the power drill will directly enter the &e open container &r&7 below (the chute, the funnel connected to the container, the storage table, the work basin, the Millstone...) &r!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Stone brushing machine reference picture:"
		"&7*There is water inside the copper grille"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/2_11.png width:256 height:142 align:center}"
	]
	quest.714DFF8B1435B67B.quest_subtitle: "&r&e Cobblestone &r—[Crush]—>Gravel—[Wash]—>Iron Particles"
	quest.714DFF8B1435B67B.title: "2.11 Mass-Producing of Iron"
	quest.7154DBA83C273F5C.quest_desc: [
		"The mission rewards in the prologue are all food, which are numerous and miscellaneous."
		""
		"It’s completely okay not to collect it after you’re done, but to collect it and eat it when you’re hungry."
	]
	quest.7154DBA83C273F5C.title: "Temporary Storage"
	quest.716AE9871B4943E8.quest_desc: [
		"Automatic farmland can be created in the Andesite Age. If you plan to become a gourmet, you can build a farm to provide raw materials."
		""
		"Well...a small area of ​​automated farmland may produce so much that it's almost impossible to use it all."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"▷A farm produces a variety of crops, such as vegetables, melons, berries, and sugar cane."
		""
		"▷Separate wheat and seeds, automatically grind wheat to make bread, and automatically transport seeds to compost."
		""
		"▷Set the timing and full box detection &7 (automatic shutdown after the box is full) &r for your farm to reduce performance usage."
		"&aTips: &r requires some simple redstone circuits. After entering the Brass Age, you can use pulse timers and stock relays to simplify the circuit."
	]
	quest.716AE9871B4943E8.title: "Automatic Farm"
	quest.71B1E3A88A7C9635.quest_desc: [
		"Propellers are the primary source of thrust and are used to control structure movement."
		""
