		""
		"&7You can also use tires."
	]
	quest.71B1E3A88A7C9635.title: "Propeller Power"
	quest.720A1FD029A7EB35.quest_desc: [
		"Hit the villager with the anvil, and the villager will forget the original transaction list &7 (that is, you are not satisfied with the transaction list, you can refresh it) &r"
