	quest.73C360170A8E199F.title: "Essential for Engineers"
	quest.7410E19C486BDA5F.quest_desc: [
		"Industrial modules often have one ring within another."
		""
		"Take your time, it's not scary at all."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aTips&r: &7&m If you want to skip class... The unassembled semi-finished product can be directly synthesized in the next step."
		""
		"After much thought, I decided to change it."
		""
		"This little trick seems to be quite useful and can be used in other integration packages."
		""
		"But in fact, most integration package authors are too lazy to write an intermediate product &7 for you (such as me)."
	]
