		"&8 evaluation is that it is better to go to hell to meet the TBM machine"
	]
	quest.750CB599AAC54B5C.title: "HS4.1.1 Control Output"
	quest.754C3BCFF567AFE2.quest_desc: [
		"Use cursed gold nuggets to build a base, place the beacon on it, and then use cursed gold to activate the &r beacon. There is a 5% chance that the beacon will become a corrupted beacon."
		""
		"The three-layer cursed gold base has a 20% probability and the fourth layer has a 100% probability of being converted into a Corruption Beacon."
		""
		"The probability of conversion to &e or 5% &r at the second level"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&a Did you know &r: My first corruption beacon was activated 37 times before it came out, surpassing 0% of the players. You should try it too!"
		""
		"&cGan!"
	]
	quest.754C3BCFF567AFE2.title: "AC1.16 European Gas Identification!"
	quest.7552BB5C0D181427.quest_desc: [
		"Attach the &e notice board &r to the &e baler &r to set the destination address of the package."
		""
		"In addition, the target address can also be set using the &e warehouse transmitter &7 (next to the warehouse manager) &r and the &e redstone requester &r."
		""
		"&aTips&r: In the warehouse dispatcher, you can use the &e filter &r to classify items in the warehouse."
	]
	quest.7552BB5C0D181427.title: "3.10 Assigning Addresses"
	quest.762F86F638041EC6.quest_desc: [
		"Usage similar to Create attribute filter"
		""
		"&8But no brass is required to craft it!"
	]
	quest.762F86F638041EC6.title: "O4.19 Attribute Filter"
	quest.765C6121F37BBFB3.quest_desc: [
		"Presumably when you build a physical structure, you don't want to watch it run away by itself, nor do you want to climb up and down in the structure and laboriously control various devices, right?"
		""
		"Then, you need to use some terminals that can be directly controlled to remotely control various devices."
		""
		"It is recommended to use &e wireless redstone typewriter &r or &e wireless redstone remote control &r."
		""
		"&aTips&r: The wireless redstone remote control can be placed on the &e podium &r."
	]
	quest.765C6121F37BBFB3.title: "Human-Computer Interaction"
	quest.76B37CC4BA85F7C4.quest_desc: ["To mass-produce bread, of course, the first step is to mass-produce wheat. Powered harvesters can automatically harvest mature crops and replant them, and need to be deployed on dynamic structures."]
	quest.76B37CC4BA85F7C4.title: "H1.1 Automated Wheat Field"
	quest.77285283F3DEA858.quest_desc: [
		"The four sides of the cross gearbox can be connected to Shafts, which can change the stress transmission direction and rotation direction."
		""
		"The two cross gearboxes can be synthesized with each other, or can be directly rotated and converted using the &e wrench &r."
		""
		"On the same straight line, the rotation directions of the two ends of the cross gearbox are opposite. If you do not wish to change the direction of rotation, consider using the &e large gear &r."
	]
	quest.77285283F3DEA858.quest_subtitle: "Okay, I admit that this part was added later, I don’t know how to label it appropriately."
	quest.7730913B25648467.quest_desc: ["At this point, a mass-produced bread production line is completed."]
	quest.7730913B25648467.title: "H1.17 Goes into Production!"
	quest.7763C28C3F9AF9AC.quest_desc: [
		"Powered harvesters can harvest a variety of crops, even kelp, berries, and cocoa beans."
		""
		"Must be used on &e dynamic structure &r!"
		""
		"&8Although a large amount of crops cannot be eaten, they can be useless, and we cannot live without them (sure)"
	]
	quest.7763C28C3F9AF9AC.quest_subtitle: "Farming can also be automated!"
	quest.7763C28C3F9AF9AC.title: "S1.7.4 Can Farming Also Be Automated?"
	quest.77F7BC95F15429A6.quest_desc: [
		"Powered grinding wheels can remove enchantments from items, convert experience particles into liquid experience, and handle all sanding recipes"
		""
		"&aTips&r: Ponder the experience particles to see what's new in the Enchanting Industry"
	]
	quest.77F7BC95F15429A6.quest_subtitle: "A pair of small grinding wheels"
	quest.77F7BC95F15429A6.title: "E1.2 Disenchanting Basin"
	quest.7822A4F7E1300F47.quest_desc: [
		"The super-limit alloy is created, and the final artifact is already &e close at hand."
		""
		"The subsequent process has basic guidance in the side missions, but each step is left to you to explore on your own."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Such as frost metal ingot\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"203380ED9BC38B15\"}}"
	]
	quest.7822A4F7E1300F47.quest_subtitle: "Those who travel a hundred miles are half ninety"
	quest.7822A4F7E1300F47.title: "H5.6 Is Over?"
	quest.78555F9C28D8F5DD.quest_desc: [
		"You made the iron production line very easily, as expected of you"
		""
		"As for flint, you can handle it yourself. I'm just here to wish it happiness."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Although flint can be used to make andesite, andesite is still very useful &7 (doubtful) &r"
	]
	quest.78555F9C28D8F5DD.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone—[Crush]—>Gravel—[Wash]—>&e Iron Nuggets"
	quest.78555F9C28D8F5DD.title: "2.14 Unlimited Iron!"
	quest.78627F8BDF656AC6.quest_desc: [
		"The next machine structure is often relatively large, and it is necessary to clear the open space in advance."
		""
		"The manipulator can place blocks and is very suitable for expanding the platform."
		""
		"In fact, Create has special workpieces for ground preparation &7 (power roller) &r, but if your base is in the sky or on the sea, a Deployer may still be more suitable for you."
		""
		"Maybe the &7 blueprint cannon is a better choice?"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"If you find that monsters are still spawning after arranging light sources in the base, you can try using &e Haunting Soul Clock &r"
	]
	quest.78627F8BDF656AC6.title: "S2.4 Expands Territory"
	quest.78AB0ED9CF3AB973.quest_desc: [
		"Use the trading desk to trade with villagers fully automatically and in unlimited quantities——"
		""
		"&7The premise is that the villagers are at work"
	]
	quest.78AB0ED9CF3AB973.title: "Automatic Trading"
	quest.78BA4EC1ACB85BB2.quest_desc: [
		"Cocoa beans and bees are harder to find, so collect some if you encounter them. They will be useful later."
		""
		"&aTips&r: You can use &e cage &r or &e resin block &r to capture bees; in addition, tools with &e precise collection and &r enchantment can dig out the honeycomb together with the bees inside."
	]
	quest.78BA4EC1ACB85BB2.title: "Have Some Dessert"
	quest.78BB766460EF42BF.quest_desc: [
		"Don’t forget that you can also use search engines to search, ask AI, or check MCmod encyclopedia, which are all very convenient options."
		""
		"In addition, there are many tutorials on site B. You can check them out to find inspiration."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"For example, this is very good\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wNPUezEnA/\"}}"
	]
	quest.78BB766460EF42BF.title: "What Should I Do If I Still Can’t Use It After Reading the Task?"
	quest.7938030579EFD8D8.quest_desc: [
		"If an anvil hits a creature &7 (such as a pig) &r and causes damage exceeding 20% ​​&r of its &e maximum health value in a single time, it will produce a corresponding drop &7 (such as pork) &r."
		""
		"Then use &e healing potion &r to milk the creatures back, and you can squeeze the dropped items infinitely."
	]
	quest.7938030579EFD8D8.title: "F2.6 Anvil Snatch"
	quest.797DC5A4D7FF51C2.quest_desc: ["Can be teleported in one direction to a sharedstone tablet of the same color"]
	quest.797DC5A4D7FF51C2.title: "O1.6 Portstone"
	quest.79A52045816BD907.quest_desc: [
		"The kitchen utensil rack is perfect for placing in your kitchen, making it easy for you to access kitchen utensils at any time."
		""
		"The recipe can simplify the cooking steps &7 (see item description for details) &r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Fruit baskets and lunch baskets are both convenient props for storing a variety of foods. The difference is:"
		""
		"The fruit basket needs to be placed on the ground. Hold the food and right-click to put the items in. Shift+right-click to take out the items."
		""
		"The lunch basket can be used in the backpack, the method is similar to the storage bag - left click to select the item, move it to the lunch basket, right click to put the item into the lunch basket &7 (or right click on the item with the lunch basket)"
		""
		"When the lunch basket is closed, long-press the right button of the lunch basket to switch the selected food; when it is open, long-press the right button of the lunch basket to eat the selected food. &7 (Hold the lunch basket and press the left mouse button against the air to toggle the switch)"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/ftbq_image/f3_5.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.79A52045816BD907.title: "F3.5 Practical kitchenware(1)"
	quest.79BCF6FADBD1CE8E.quest_desc: [
		"Then there is the gear, which has the additional function of &e horizontal transmission &r on top of the basic function of the Shaft."
		""
		"Consistent with the physics in reality, when the large gear drives the small gear horizontally, the speed doubles, and vice versa."
		""
		"Use the right button of the &e case &r to wrap the gear and cover the Shaft of the gear. The Shaft can be re-exposed using a wrench, or the case can be removed."
		""
		"Some workpieces (such as Millstones) contain gears and can also be used as gears."
		""
		"{\"text\":\"Variation and stress\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"112A60B1E4DAD6AD\"}}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The large gears cannot be directly connected horizontally to each other, and a small gear is required as an intermediate transmission component."
		""
		"Since the upper limit of &e speed is 256RPM &r, when the speed exceeds the upper limit, the gear will be directly destroyed &7 (the Shaft is also &r). Therefore, when transmitting stress in an oblique direction, it is recommended to use a large gear as the &e idler gear &7 (intermediate transmission gear) &f, or directly use the more convenient &e conveyor belt &r."
	]
	quest.79BCF6FADBD1CE8E.quest_subtitle: "The lack of a number is definitely not because I forgot it."
	quest.79F73F15B08EC5D1.quest_desc: [
		"Physical structures often need to be moved during construction. The most basic method is to directly &e attack the &r physical structure, or drag the &e iron handle &r on the structure."
		""
		"However, the mass that can be moved by these methods is really limited, and you may need some advanced props."
		""
		"&aTips&r: A &eDeployer&r can use &etopaz&7 (consumed)&r / &etopaz block&7 (not consumed)&r to process iron blocks into &ehollow magnetite blocks&r."
	]
	quest.79F73F15B08EC5D1.title: "Debugging, Moving"
	quest.7A0C5244D1ABB4B9.quest_desc: ["Have you noticed that you can put the backpack down and put it back? These two upgrades can make the backpack more convenient to use as a storage element."]
	quest.7A0C5244D1ABB4B9.title: "O2.25 Put Down Your Backpack and Immediately Turn the Place into a Warehouse"
	quest.7A2900B878E9889C.quest_desc: [
		"Can store 8.2k items."
		""
		"A frequency will be randomly assigned when placed. You can use the &e link tool &r to store and apply the frequency."
		""
		"Ender drawers of the same frequency share storage contents."
		""
		"&aTips&r: If the frequency is lost, the item will be difficult to retrieve, so it is not recommended to store valuable items."
	]
	quest.7A2900B878E9889C.title: "3.9 Wireless Transmission"
	quest.7A5EDF15A6FFCA13.quest_desc: [
		"After being struck by lightning, the experience block can be turned into a transcendent experience block, thereby creating a forging template dedicated to transcendent enchantment."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Use &e Topaz &r to right-click the lightning rod to trigger lightning."
	]
	quest.7A5EDF15A6FFCA13.title: "E1.11 Beyond Enchantment Template"
	quest.7A7825991729C7EB.quest_desc: ["Regardless of whether you know redstone or not, collect more when you encounter it. You will use it to make strawberry-flavored lollipops &7 (Rose Quartz) in the future."]
	quest.7A7825991729C7EB.title: "S1.3.3 Redstone, I Don’t Know How to Do It?"
	quest.7A7FAEAFA2CF05EE.quest_desc: [
		"Adjusting the flow of cobbles to produce quartz and the ratio of diorite production is undoubtedly complicated and cumbersome."
		""
		"Why not use &e factory meter &r to automatically distribute? Go and try it!"
	]
	quest.7A7FAEAFA2CF05EE.title: "HS3.5.3 Automated Allocation"
	quest.7A83749D7279F353.quest_desc: [
		"Who doesn’t want an airship, plane or ship!"
		""
		"This part of the content is to teach you how to build &e airship &r. &e ship &r requires you to make analogies."
		""
		"&e aircraft &r will be more difficult. Although it will also be mentioned, it is recommended that you refer to the following video to learn:"
		"{\"text\":\"A concise fixed-wing tutorial\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xCo7BKEdg\"}}"
	]
	quest.7A83749D7279F353.title: "Aircraft/Ships"
	quest.7ADEAB99C8CE4802.quest_desc: [
		"&e Create: Aeronautics &r is an emerging Create attachment that allows you to build aircraft freely - so freely that it is almost impossible to start."
		""
		"But no matter what you want to do, it is always right to first build a &e physical assembler &r: it can convert your creation into a &e physical structure &r, so that you can further build airplanes, ships, cars..."
		""
		"Afterwards, you can continue building directly on the physical structure."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Please take good care of your cane, its synthetic formula is very expensive"
	]
	quest.7ADEAB99C8CE4802.title: "Aeronautics"
	quest.7B1C99709A83DCEA.quest_desc: ["Jade &7 (Jade) &r can help you quickly confirm the information of creatures, blocks, etc. &7 (displayed in the middle of the top of the screen) &r, you can further search based on the given name and module information"]
	quest.7B1C99709A83DCEA.quest_subtitle: "What's that？"
	quest.7B1C99709A83DCEA.title: "What Is That Stuff?"
	quest.7B351A912F847C76.quest_desc: ["Used with connectors to connect remote containers to the storage network"]
	quest.7B351A912F847C76.title: "O4.12 Pull Network Cable"
	quest.7B3DC5DA1E2B6C12.quest_desc: [
		"The AnvilCraft block placer is cheap and easy to use, and requires no electricity or stress, but it cannot replace the hand of God..."
		""
		"&aTips&r: See the tutorial book for details"
		""
		"&8…but the crab claws really destroyed the telescopic manipulator…"
	]
	quest.7B3DC5DA1E2B6C12.quest_subtitle: "Telescopic manipulator:?"
	quest.7B3DC5DA1E2B6C12.title: "AC1.3.2 Deployer Youth Edition"
	quest.7B4967505448D27D.quest_desc: [
		"When combining two heavy halberds, &e will inherit the enchantment of the raw material &r, so you can directly synthesize it with the weapon in your hand."
		""
		"The heavy halberd not only has high damage and high attack speed, it can also be used as a trident and heavy hammer."
		""
		"&8 can also cut vegetables"
	]
	quest.7B4967505448D27D.title: "AC1.21.11 Dagger, Fiery Dagger, Explosion"
	quest.7B8601DCACCF5152.quest_desc: [
		"The gear block has the same function as redstone powder, but it can be placed in the air, or a redstone torch can be inserted directly on the gear."
		""
		"With it, it will be easy to deal with the AnvilCraft (thumbs up)"
	]
	quest.7B8601DCACCF5152.title: "AC1.6.4 Floating Redstone Powder"
	quest.7C164BA476E7CD5B.quest_desc: ["&e time shift &r meat and head can obtain crude oil"]
	quest.7C164BA476E7CD5B.title: "AC1.18 AC1.18Beware of Mold Growth"
	quest.7C4308026EBF4714.quest_desc: ["Place a Chain Drive near the warehouse, slightly higher, because Wrogang can only interact with chains that are no lower than its own height."]
	quest.7CBCEFD6188F3C75.quest_desc: [
		"This task is just to list them, after all, their item descriptions are very clear."
		""
		"Add a separate method of using the &e block placer &r:"
		""
		"&e left click &r to select the block, &e right click &r to place the block, &eShift+right click &r to open the configuration panel."
	]
	quest.7CBCEFD6188F3C75.title: "S2.8.2 Messy Stuff"
	quest.7CDA849025C588AC.quest_desc: ["Put it on the &e baler &r and build your logistics network!"]
	quest.7CDA849025C588AC.title: "3.9 Logistics Network"
	quest.7CF1AA66784FE146.quest_desc: [
		"If you are not good at martial arts, you can get blaze powder by smashing the Blaze Burner..."
		""
		"&7But...it will curse you..."
		""
		"&7But cursing is not a bad thing?"
	]
	quest.7CF1AA66784FE146.quest_subtitle: "Come to cheat, come to sneak attack"
	quest.7CF1AA66784FE146.title: "S2.2.3 Don’t Fight, Don’t Fight"
	quest.7D1FB9AC8C967828.quest_desc: ["Crush granite into red sand and finally send it to washing to get gold particles"]
	quest.7D1FB9AC8C967828.title: "H3.7 One Step Away"
	quest.7D51D96006CB0199.quest_desc: [
		"Collect some raw materials to make a Waystone."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Now ender pearls can be recycled!"
	]
	quest.7D51D96006CB0199.title: "O1.1 Raw Materials"
	quest.7DBF6F727C671718.quest_desc: ["Using the contact signal generator and wireless redstone, automatic round-trip can be achieved"]
	quest.7DBF6F727C671718.title: "H1.6 Automated Reverse"
	quest.7DE975B729E0C49E.quest_desc: ["Use your eloquence to convince the Blaze to work for you ("]
	quest.7DE975B729E0C49E.title: "1.10 Mom, Look, Blaze!"
	quest.7DF4BEFADBEB9ADF.quest_desc: [
		"It looks like you are going to the ancient city to find trouble with the defenders."
		""
		"&aTips&r: AnvilCraft adds a renewable route for Echo Shards: mobs defeated by a Warden's &esonic boom&r&7 (a Snow Golem is recommended)&r will drop one extra Echo Shard."
	]
	quest.7DF4BEFADBEB9ADF.title: "AC1.21.8 Resonator Core"
	quest.7E272446BF72E20D.quest_desc: [
		"Although you can put the chicken on a funnel and easily collect eggs automatically..."
		""
		"But after all, you shouldn't be reduced to the point where you even need to squeeze the chickens in the game...right...?"
		""
		"Consider building a grand chicken farm &7 (nothing to do) &r to give your animal employees a good working environment and then let them drive trains."
		""
		"&7In addition to chickens, should we also consider other animals?"
	]
	quest.7E272446BF72E20D.title: "HS4.2.2 Treat Your Employees Humanely"
	quest.7E37D652F20B3E43.quest_desc: ["Convenient stacking upgrade for mass production, more use"]
	quest.7E37D652F20B3E43.title: "O2.12 Is Used a Lot"
	quest.7E822A094AFA032E.quest_desc: [
		"In the Ember Forging Station, use the four-in-one forging template and the heavy halberd core to make a heavy halberd."
		""
		"The heavy halberd not only has high damage and high attack speed, it can also be used as a trident, heavy hammer and &e knife &7 (kitchen knife)"
		""
		"&aTips&r: In the end of &e and &r, there are many scattered trial rooms and many treasure troves."
		""
		"Now that the trident has a manufacturing recipe, the treasure house can also open &7 repeatedly (put the lead block on the treasure house, smash it with the falling anvil, and you can open the treasure house again) &r."
	]
	quest.7E822A094AFA032E.quest_subtitle: "Thousand Chances Umbrella!"
	quest.7E822A094AFA032E.title: "S2.17.7 Multifunctional Weapon"
	quest.7EC51B1111DC5998.quest_desc: [
		"The direction of movement of the crane structure depends on the direction of rotation of the crane mast"
		""
		"The reverse gearbox will reverse the direction of rotation upon receiving a redstone signal, allowing the crane structure to travel back and forth"
	]
	quest.7EC51B1111DC5998.title: "H1.5 Come Back!"
	quest.7ECC4D0574D29CF2.quest_desc: [
		"Rotating bearings can split one physical structure into two physical structures."
		""
		"You can also prepare two physical structures in advance and use &e docking connector &r or &e adhesive connector &r to achieve connection and separation."
		""
		"Its most important function is to cooperate with the &e copper valve handwheel &r to realize the &e rotation of the physical structure at any angle."
	]
	quest.7ECC4D0574D29CF2.title: "Split"
	quest.7F3FBAD2ADE01B06.quest_desc: [
		"The sorted wheat flour is sent to batch washing and processed into dough."
		""
		"&aTips&r: Water-containing cubes can also be used for batch washing. The most convenient ones are water-containing leaves."
	]
	quest.7F3FBAD2ADE01B06.title: "H1.13 Bulk Washing"
	quest.7F45495C1C98D740.quest_desc: [
		"It's also a good idea to use the hoppers in Tom's Simple Storage to feed stacked synths"
		""
		"However, I will not provide relevant tutorials here. If you plan to do this, please check the MCMOD Wiki yourself."
	]
